<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Asomafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Asomafoɔ No Nnwuma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Asomafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aso</para>
  <para style="mt1">Asomafoɔ No Nnwuma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Asafo No Asehyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Mʼadamfo pa Teofilo, me nwoma a ɛdi ɛkan a metwerɛɛ wo no mu no, mekaa Yesu nnwuma a ɔyɛeɛ ne ne nkyerɛkyerɛ <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>kɔsi ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn bɛfaa no kɔɔ ɔsoro no ho asɛm. Ansa na wɔrebɛfa no akɔ ɔsoro no, ɔnam Honhom Kronkron tumi so kyerɛkyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Ne wusɔreɛ akyi, ɔtenaa asase so adaduanan, yii ne ho adi mpɛn pii kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no de kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ampa, ɔte ase. Ɔkaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho asɛm nso kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Ɛda bi a ɔne wɔn redidi no, ɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommfiri Yerusalem, na montwɛn akyɛdeɛ a mʼAgya ahyɛ mo ho bɔ a maka ho asɛm akyerɛ mo no.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><char style="wj">Yohane de, ɔde nsuo na ɛbɔɔ asu, nanso mo de ɛrenkyɛre, wɔde Honhom Kronkron no bɛbɔ mo asu.”</char><verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sorokɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Asuafoɔ no nyinaa ne Yesu hyiaa mu no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, berɛ yi mu na wode ahennie no bɛba Israel anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛho nhia sɛ mobɛhunu ɛberɛ a Agya no nam ne tumi so ahyehyɛ ato hɔ no.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ Honhom Kronkron no ba mo so a, mobɛnya tumi na moayɛ mʼadansefoɔ wɔ Yerusalem ne Yudea nyinaa ne Samaria kɔsi asase ano.”</char><verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Ɔkasa wieeɛ no, asuafoɔ no hunuu no sɛ ɔnam omununkum mu rekɔ ɔsoro na wɔanhunu no bio.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Wɔgu so rehwɛ ewiem no, amonom hɔ ara, mmarima baanu bi a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa bɛgyinaa wɔn nkyɛn, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>kaa sɛ, “Mo mmarima a mofiri Galilea, adɛn enti na mogyina ha rehwɛ ewiem? Yesu a wɔafa no afiri mo nkyɛn kɔ ɔsoro no, sɛdeɛ ɔsi kɔɔ ɔsoro no, saa ara na ɔbɛsane aba bio.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔyi Matia Sɛ Yuda Nanmusini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Yei akyi no, asuafoɔ no firii Ngo Bepɔ no so baa Yerusalem. Ɛfiri Ngo Bepɔ no so ba Yerusalem no bɛyɛ kilomita baako ne fa. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ ɛdan bi a na ɛwɔ aborɔsan a na wɔte so mu. Nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ no ne:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:13"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Petro, Yohane, Yakobo ne Andrea;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Filipo, Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Bartolomeo, Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Alfeo ba Yakobo, Simon Seloteni ne Yakobo ba Yuda.<verse eid="ACT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Na saa asuafoɔ yi nyinaa taa ne mmaa bi te sɛ Yesu maame Maria ne Yesu nnua mmarimanom hyia bɔ mpaeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Nna kakra bi akyi no, agyidifoɔ no a wɔn dodoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ ɔha aduonu no hyiaeɛ na Petro sɔre kasaa sɛ: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>Me nuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ nkɔm a Honhom Kronkron no nam Dawid so hyɛ faa Yuda ho sɛ ɛnam ne so na wɔbɛkyere Yesu no ba mu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Yɛn a Yesu yii yɛn no, na Yuda nso ka yɛn ho wɔ ɔsom no mu.<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>(Sika a Yuda nya firii ade bɔne a ɔyɛeɛ no mu no, wɔde tɔɔ asase wɔ faako a ɔwuiɛ hɔ. Ɔte bɛhwee fam maa ne mu paeeɛ maa nʼayamdeɛ tu guu so. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Nnipa a na wɔte Yerusalem nyinaa tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔtoo asase no din wɔ wɔn ankasa kasa mu sɛ Hekeldama a asekyerɛ ne sɛ, Mogya Asase.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Petro toaa so kaa sɛ, “Wɔatwerɛ wɔ Dawid nnwom mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Ne efie nna mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">na ne som adwuma no, obi mfa.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>Enti ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyi nnipa a yɛne wɔn nantee ɛberɛ a na Yesu ne yɛn dii akɔneaba no nyinaa, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>firi Yohane asubɔ adwuma no so de kɔsi ɛberɛ a wɔfaa Yesu firii yɛn nkyɛn kɔɔ ɔsoro no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ saa nnipa no mu baako bɛka yɛn ho ne yɛn di Yesu wusɔreɛ no ho adanseɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Wɔyii nnipa baanu. Ɔbaako din de Yosef a na wɔfrɛ no Barsaba, na wɔtaa nso frɛ no Yusto. Deɛ na ɔka ho no nso din de Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, “Awurade, wonim obiara akoma mu. Ɛno enti, kyerɛ yɛn nnipa baanu yi mu deɛ woayi no, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>sɛ ɔmmɛsi Yuda a wanya ne baabi kɔ no ananmu mmɛyɛ asomafodwuma no.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no bɔɔ wɔn so ntonto maa ɛsii Matia. Enti wɔfaa no kaa asomafoɔ dubaako no ho.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Pentekoste Da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Pentekoste da<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Twam Afahyɛ homeda no akyi nnafua aduonum (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-16">3 Mose 23.15-16</ref></char>).</char></note> no duruiɛ no, na asuafoɔ no nyinaa ahyia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asuafoɔ dodoɔ a deɛ asi dada enti yɛka wɔn ho asɛm ne dubaako no (ne Matia) nanso dodoɔ yi, wɔn a wɔbɔ wɔn din nyinaa wɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:13-15">1.13-15</ref></char>.</char></note> wɔ faako.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛnyɛ abansoro dan a wɔte mu no (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:13">1.13</ref></char>) na mmom hyiadan no ho baabi. Ɛfiri sɛ ɛberɛ biara a wɔabue hyiadan no, na asuafoɔ no wɔ hɔ.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɛnne bi te sɛ ahum a ɛretu firi ɔsoro baeɛ bɛhyɛɛ efie a na wɔwɔ mu no ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Egya a ɛrederɛ a ɛte sɛ tɛkrɛma bɛsisii wɔn so mmaako mmaako. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Honhom Kronkron no hyɛɛ wɔn nyinaa ma, na wɔkaa kasa foforɔ, sɛdeɛ Honhom no maa wɔn ho kwan.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Yudafoɔ bi a wɔfɛre Onyame firi mmeaeɛ mmeaeɛ aba Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Wɔtee deɛ ɛrekɔ so no, wɔbɔɔ twi bɛhyiaeɛ, na ɛyɛɛ wɔn nwanwa ne ahodwirie, ɛfiri sɛ, obiara tee sɛ wɔreka ne kurom kasa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Enti, wɔbisaa sɛ, “Na saa nnipa yi a wɔrekasa yi nyɛ Galileafoɔ anaa? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Na adɛn enti na yɛte sɛ wɔreka Onyankopɔn anwanwadwuma ho asɛm wɔ yɛn a yɛyɛ <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Partifoɔ, Mediafoɔ ne Elamfoɔ, ne wɔn a wɔte Mesopotamia ne Yudea ne Kapadokia, Ponto, Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Frigia ne Pamfilia, Misraim ne Libia fa a ɛbɛn Kirene ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔfiri Roma, Yudafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔasakyera aba Yudasom mu, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>ne Kretafoɔ ne Arabfoɔ mu biara kasa mu yi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Wɔde ahodwirie bisaa sɛ, “Yei ase ne sɛn?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Afoforɔ nso dii wɔn ho fɛ sɛ, “Saa nnipa yi aboboro nsã.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kasa Kyerɛ Dɔm No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Petro ne asomafoɔ dubaako no sɔre gyinaa hɔ na ɔkasaa dendeenden kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, “Me nuanom Yudafoɔ ne mo a mote Yerusalem nyinaa, montie asɛm a mereka yi. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Saa nnipa yi mmoboroo nsã sɛdeɛ mosusu no, ɛfiri sɛ, adeɛ nnya nkyee a ɛsɛ sɛ obi nom nsã boro. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Asɛm a asi yi na odiyifoɔ Yoɛl hyɛɛ ho nkɔm sɛ:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>“ ‘Onyankopɔn kaa sɛ, nna a ɛdi akyire no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mɛhwie me Honhom no agu nnipa nyinaa so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mo mmammarima ne mo mmammaa bɛhyɛ nkɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mo mmeranteɛ nso ahunu anisoadeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Na mo mpanin nso asoso adaeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Saa mmerɛ no mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mɛhwie me Honhom agu mʼasomfoɔ mpo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mmarima ne mmaa, ama wɔahyɛ nkɔm.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Mede mogya ne ogya ne wisie kumɔnn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">bɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">wɔ ɔsoro ne asase so.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Ansa na Awurade da kɛseɛ no bɛba no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">owia bɛduru sum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">na ɔsrane nso ayɛ sɛ mogya.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Na obiara a ɔbɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Awurade din no bɛnya nkwa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Israelfoɔ, montie! Yesu Nasareni no yɛ ɔbarima bi a ne dwuma kronkron a ɔbɛdiiɛ no daa adi wɔ tumi ne anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a Onyankopɔn nam ne so yɛeɛ a mo ankasa di ho adanseɛ no mu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Onyankopɔn ankasa firi ne pɛ ne ne nhunumu mu sii no gyinaeɛ sɛ wɔbɛyi Yesu ama mo, na mode no maa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ma wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu kumm no. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn nyanee no firii owuo mu maa ɔyii no firii owuyea mu, ɛfiri sɛ, owuo antumi anni ne so.” <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Asɛm a Dawid ka faa ne ho ne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Mehunu Awurade wɔ mʼani so daa nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Esiane sɛ ɔwɔ me nsa nifa enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">merenhinhim da.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Ɛno enti, me kra ani gye, na me de me tɛkrɛma di ahurisie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Me onipadua nso bɛhome asomdwoeɛ mu.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, worennya me awufoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Na woremma wo Kronkronni no mporɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Woakyerɛ me nkwagyeɛ ɛkwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">na wobɛma mʼani agye wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ meda mʼadwene adi pefee wɔ yɛn panin Dawid ho. Ɔwuiɛ na wɔsiee no, na ne damena da so wɔ hɔ bɛsi ɛnnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Na ɔyɛ odiyifoɔ a ɔnim bɔ bi a Onyankopɔn ahyɛ no no. Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ bɔ bi sɛ ɔbɛyɛ Dawid aseni ɔhene, sɛdeɛ Dawid yɛ ɔhene no ara pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Dawid hunuu deɛ Onyankopɔn rebɛyɛ no, ɔkasa faa owusɔreɛ a ɛfa Agyenkwa no ho sɛ, ‘Wɔannya no awufoɔ mu. Ne honam nso amporɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Onyankopɔn anyane saa Yesu yi afiri owuo mu, na yɛn nyinaa yɛ saa asɛm yi ho adansefoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Wɔahyɛ no animuonyam de no akɔtena Onyankopɔn nifa so ma ne nsa aka Honhom Kronkron no a Agya no hyɛɛ no ɛho bɔ no; ɛno na wahwie agu yɛn so a ɛho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ na mohunu na mote yi. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Dawid ankasa de, wankɔ ɔsoro, na mmom, ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“ ‘Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“Tena me nsa nifa so ha,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>kɔsi sɛ mede wʼatamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">bɛyɛ wo nan ntiasoɔ.” ’<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ Israel nyinaa hunu sɛ, mo na mobɔɔ saa Yesu yi a Onyankopɔn ayɛ no Awurade ne Agyenkwa no asɛnnua mu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no tee saa asɛm yi no, ɛhaa wɔn yie. Enti, wɔbisaa Petro ne asomafoɔ a aka no sɛ, “Anuanom, ɛdeɛn na yɛnyɛ?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnu mo ho na wɔmmɔ mo asu wɔ Yesu Kristo din mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔde mo bɔne bɛkyɛ mo na moanya Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ a ɛyɛ Honhom Kronkron no. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ Honhom Kronkron yi ho bɔ maa mo ne mo mma ne wɔn a wɔtete akyirikyiri ne wɔn a Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn, bɛfrɛ wɔn aba ne nkyɛn no nyinaa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Petro kaa nsɛm bebree kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnye mo ho mfiri asotwe a ɛreba saa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ yi so no mu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Wɔn mu dodoɔ no ara gyee asɛm no diiɛ maa wɔbɔɔ wɔn asu. Saa ɛda no, nnipa bɛyɛ mpensa na wɔbɛkaa agyidifoɔ no ho.<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo No Asetena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Daa na wɔde wɔn adagyeɛ nyinaa sua asomafoɔ no nkyerɛkyerɛ. Wɔne wɔn nyaa ayɔnkofa, hyia didi bɔɔ mu ne wɔn bɔɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Asomafoɔ no yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ bebree maa obiara a ɔhunuiɛ no ho dwirii no. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Agyidifoɔ no nyinaa kɔɔ so tenaa ase sɛ nnipa korɔ, na wɔkyekyɛɛ wɔn ahodeɛ mu momaa wɔn ho wɔn ho. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Wɔtɔn wɔn ahodeɛ kyekyɛɛ sika a wɔnya firii mu no maa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛdeɛ ɛho hia obiara. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Daa na wɔbɔ mu hyia wɔ asɔredan mu de anigyeɛ ne akoma pa bɔ mu didi wɔ wɔn afie mu, kamfo Onyankopɔn, nya animuonyam wɔ nnipa anim. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Ɛda biara na Awurade de wɔn a ɔgye wɔn nkwa no bɛka wɔn ho.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Obubuafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Ɛda bi Petro ne Yohane kɔɔ asɔredan mu awia nnɔnmiɛnsa a ɛyɛ ɛberɛ a wɔde bɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Wɔreyɛ aduru asɔredan ɛpono a wɔfrɛ no Ɛpono Fɛɛfɛ ano no, wɔhunuu obubuafoɔ bi sɛ ɔda hɔ. Na wɔsoa saa obubuafoɔ yi de no bɛto ɛpono yi ano da biara ma ɔsrɛsrɛ sika firi wɔn a wɔrekɔ asɔredan no mu no nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhunuu sɛ Petro ne Yohane rekɔ mu no, ɔsrɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmma no biribi. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Wɔhwɛɛ nʼanim dinn na Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Hwɛ yɛn!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Ɔhwɛɛ wɔn susuu sɛ wɔbɛma no biribi.<verse eid="ACT 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Nanso, Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sika de, menni bi; na deɛ mewɔ a mede bɛma wo ne sɛ, Yesu Kristo Nasareni din mu, sɔre nante!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Afei, Petro de ne nsa nifa sɔɔ ne mu maa ne so gyinaa hɔ. Prɛko pɛ, ne nan no mu yɛɛ den. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Ɔhuri gyinaa ne nan so, na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ nanteeɛ. Afei, ɔne wɔn nyinaa kɔɔ asɔredan no mu a ɔrehurihuri, rekamfo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Nnipa no nyinaa hunuu no sɛ ɔnam reyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Wɔhunuu no no, wohunuu sɛ ɔno ne ɔdesrɛni a na ɔda asɔredan ɛpono a wɔfrɛ no Ɛpono Fɛɛfɛ no ano no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kasa Kyerɛ Nnipa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no hunuu sɛ ɔbarima no ne Petro ne Yohane nam no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn; enti wɔtuu mmirika kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn, wɔ baabi a wɔfrɛ no Salomo Abrannaa no so hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Ɛberɛ a Petro hunuu nnipadɔm no no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Israelfoɔ, adɛn na yei yɛ mo nwanwa? Adɛn enti na mohwɛ yɛn, susu sɛ yɛnam yɛn tumi anaa yɛn som pa so na asa ɔbarima yi yadeɛ? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Abraham, Isak ne Yakob Onyankopɔn ne yɛn nananom Onyankopɔn ama ne ɔsomfoɔ Yesu ɔsoro animuonyam. Mode no maa atumfoɔ; na ɛberɛ a Pilato yɛɛ sɛ ɔbɛgyaa no no mpo, mopoo no wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Na ɔyɛ Kronkron, ɔtene; nanso mopoo no na mosrɛɛ Pilato sɛ ɔmfa odwotwafoɔ mma mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Enti, mokumm obi a ɔgye nnipa kɔ nkwa mu. Nanso, Onyankopɔn nyanee no firii awufoɔ mu na yɛyɛ yei ho adansefoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Tumi a ɛwɔ ne din mu no na ɛmaa saa obubuafoɔ yi nyaa ahoɔden. Gyidie a yɛwɔ wɔ ne din mu no na ɛmaa yɛtumi yɛɛ saa anwanwadeɛ a mohunu yi. Gyidie a yɛwɔ wɔ Yesu din mu no na ama ne ho atɔ no a ɔgyina mo anim seesei yi.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>“Afei, me nuanom, menim sɛ deɛ mo ne mo mpanimfoɔ yɛɛ Yesu no, na ɔnim na monnim. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Tete no, Onyankopɔn nam nʼadiyifoɔ so kaa sɛ Agyenkwa no bɛhunu amane. Na ɔnam saa ɛkwan yi so maa ɛbaa mu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Monnu mo ho na monni Onyankopɔn akyi, na ɔde mo bɔne akyɛ mo, <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Awurade Honhom mu ahoɔden bɛba na wasoma Yesu a ɔyɛ Agyenkwa no a wayi no ama mo dada no. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn nam nʼadiyifoɔ kronkron so aka dada no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtena ɔsoro kɔsi sɛ nneɛma nyinaa bɛyɛ foforɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Na Mose kaa sɛ, ‘Awurade, mo Onyankopɔn bɛsoma odiyifoɔ aba mo nkyɛn sɛdeɛ ɔsomaa me a mefiri mo mu no. Ɛsɛ sɛ motie asɛm biara a ɔbɛka akyerɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Obiara a wantie deɛ odiyifoɔ no bɛka no, wɔbɛyi no afiri Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ ho na wɔasɛe no.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>“Samuel ne adiyifoɔ a akyire no wɔbaeɛ no nyinaa nso aka asɛm a asi ɛnnɛ yi ho asɛm pɛn. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Onyankopɔn bɔ a ɔnam adiyifoɔ so hyɛeɛ no yɛ mo dea. Saa ara nso na mowɔ kyɛfa wɔ apam a Onyankopɔn ne mo agyanom pameeɛ no mu. Sɛdeɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ Abraham sɛ, ‘Wʼasefoɔ so na menam mɛhyira ewiasefoɔ nyinaa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Enti, Onyankopɔn dii ɛkan yii ne ɔsomfoɔ somaa no baa mo nkyɛn sɛ ɔmmɛdom mo na mo nyinaa nnane mfiri mo akwammɔne no so.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Petro Ne Yohane Gyina Asɛnniiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Petro ne Yohane gu so rekasa akyerɛ nkurɔfoɔ no, asɔfoɔ ne ɔpanin a ɔhwɛ awɛmfoɔ a wɔhwɛ asɔredan no so no ne Sadukifoɔ baa wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Wɔn bo fuu yie, ɛfiri sɛ, na saa asomafoɔ yi rekyerɛkyerɛ nnipa no sɛ Yesu asɔre afiri owuo mu a ɛkyerɛ sɛ awufoɔ tumi nyane ba nkwa mu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Wɔkyeree asomafoɔ no, nanso ɛsiane sɛ na adeɛ asa enti, wɔde wɔn guu afiase kɔsii adekyeeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Nanso nnipa a wɔtee asɛm no mu dodoɔ no ara bɛyɛ sɛ mpemnum gyee asɛm no diiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yudafoɔ mpanin, mpanimfoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ hyiaa wɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Wɔhyiaa Ɔsɔfopanin Anas ne Kaiafa ne Yohane ne Aleksandro ne afoforɔ a wɔfiri Ɔsɔfopanin no abusua mu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Wɔmaa wɔde asomafoɔ baanu yi baa wɔn anim bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Tumi bɛn anaa hwan din na mode yɛɛ yei?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Petro a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma no buaa sɛ, “Ɔman mpanimfoɔ ne atitire. <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Sɛ ɛnnɛ mogyina ha bisa yɛn ade pa a yɛyɛ maa obubuafoɔ no maa ne ho tɔɔ no no a, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>ɛnneɛ ɛsɛ sɛ mo ne Israelfoɔ nyinaa hunu sɛ, saa onipa a ɔgyina ha yi, ɛnam Yesu Kristo a ɔfiri Nasaret a mobɔɔ no asɛnnua mu na Onyankopɔn nyanee no firii awufoɔ mu no tumi mu na ne ho ayɛ no den.” <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Yesu ne onipa a Atwerɛsɛm ka fa ne ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Ɛboɔ a mo adansifoɔ poeɛ no a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">abɛyɛ tweatiboɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Ɔno nko ara mu na nkwagyeɛ wɔ; ɛfiri sɛ, edin biara nni ewiase ha a nnipa nam so bɛnya nkwagyeɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Ɛyɛɛ agyinatufoɔ no ahodwirie sɛ Petro ne Yohane a wɔnsuaa nwoma da na wɔyɛ nnipa teta no tumi kasa akokoɔduru so saa. Wɔhunuu sɛ saa asomafoɔ yi ne Yesu nanteeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Nnipa no antumi anka asɛm biara bio, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔhunuu sɛ ɔbarima a na ne ho atɔ no no ne Petro ne Yohane gyina hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Wɔmaa wɔfirii asɛnniiɛ hɔ ma wɔdwendwenee asɛm no ho. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na yɛnyɛ saa nnipa yi? Obiara a ɔwɔ Yerusalem ha ate sɛ saa nnipa yi ayɛ anwanwadeɛ a yɛrentumi ntwa ho nkontompo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a saa nnipa yi remma saa asɛm yi ntrɛ nkɔ afoforɔ nkyɛn no, momma yɛmfrɛ wɔn, mmɔ wɔn kɔkɔ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔremmɔ Yesu din nkyerɛ obiara bio.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Wɔfrɛɛ asomafoɔ baanu yi baeɛ, hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnni ho kwan biara sɛ wɔbɔ Yesu Kristo din anaa wɔkyerɛkyerɛ wɔ ne din mu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Petro ne Yohane buaa wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ yɛbɛtie Onyankopɔn anaa yɛbɛtie mo no, emu deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ? Mo ara mommua mfa. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Deɛ yɛahunu ne deɛ yɛate deɛ, yɛrentumi nnyae ho asɛnka.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Agyinatufoɔ no bɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ bio gyaee wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔannya biribiara annyina so antwe wɔn aso; afei nso, na nnipa no nyinaa rekamfo Onyankopɔn wɔ asɛm a asi no ho. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Na ɔbarima a wɔnam anwanwakwan so saa no yadeɛ no adi boro mfeɛ aduanan.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agyidifoɔ No Mpaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Wɔgyaee Petro ne Yohane pɛ, wɔkɔɔ agyidifoɔ a aka no nkyɛn kɔkaa deɛ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne mpanimfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔtee saa asɛm no, wɔn nyinaa bɔɔ mu bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, “Owura, Ɔbɔadeɛ a wobɔɔ ɔsoro, asase ne ɛpo ne biribiara a ɛwɔ mu, <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>wonam Honhom Kronkron so nam yɛn nana Dawid a ɔyɛ wʼakoa no so maa ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“Adɛn enti na amanamanmufoɔ no bo afu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Adɛn enti na wɔsɛe mmerɛ yɛ nhyehyɛeɛ hunu yi?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Asase so ahemfo sɔre gyina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na atumfoɔ bom tu agyina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">tia Awurade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ne Agyenkwa no.<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Ampa ara Herode ne Pontio Pilato ne amanamanmufoɔ ne Israelfoɔ hyiaa wɔ kuro kɛseɛ yi mu sɔre tiaa Yesu a ɔyɛ Ɔsomfoɔ Kronkron a woate ne ho no. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Wɔhyia yɛɛ biribiara a wonam wo tumi ne wo pɛ so ahyɛ ato hɔ sɛ ɛbɛba mu no. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Afei, Awurade, hwɛ ahunahuna a wɔrehunahuna yɛn yi na ma yɛn a yɛyɛ wʼasomfoɔ yi mfa akokoɔduru nka wʼasɛm yi. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Ma wo nsa so fa sa nyarewa, na fa wo ɔsomfoɔ Kronkron Yesu Kristo din so yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Wɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ wieeɛ no, faako a wɔhyiaeɛ hɔ wosoeɛ. Honhom Kronkron bɛhyɛɛ wɔn nyinaa ma ma na wɔfirii aseɛ de akokoɔduru kaa Onyankopɔn asɛm.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agyidifoɔ No Asetena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Agyidifoɔ no nyinaa tenaa ase sɛ nnipa korɔ. Wɔn mu bi anka sɛ nʼankasa ahodeɛ bi yɛ ɔno nko ara dea; biribiara a wɔwɔ no, wɔn nyinaa kyekyɛɛ mu pɛ faeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Asomafoɔ no nam tumi a emu yɛ den so dii Awurade Yesu wusɔreɛ no ho adanseɛ na Onyankopɔn hyiraa wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Biribiara ho anhia obiara a ɔfra kuo no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a na wɔwɔ nsase ne afie no tontɔneeɛ de sika a wɔnya firii mu no <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>brɛɛ asomafoɔ no maa wɔkyekyɛeɛ sɛdeɛ ɛho hia obiara.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Yosef a na ɔyɛ Lewini a ɔfiri Kipro a na asomafoɔ no frɛ no Barnaba, a asekyerɛ ne “Nkuranhyɛ Ba” no, <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>tɔn nʼasase de sika a ɔnyaeɛ no brɛɛ asomafoɔ no.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Anania Ne Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Anania ne ne yere Safira kɔtɔn wɔn agyapadeɛ bi. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Ɔne ne yere yi yɛɛ adwene de sika a wɔnyaeɛ no bi sieeɛ na wɔde nkaeɛ no brɛɛ asomafoɔ no.<verse eid="ACT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Petro bisaa no sɛ, “Anania, adɛn enti na woama ɔbonsam ho kwan ama wabɛhyɛ wo mu na woadi atorɔ akyerɛ Honhom Kronkron no na wode sika a wonyaeɛ no bi asie? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Ansa na worebɛtɔn agyapadeɛ no na ɛyɛ wʼankasa wo dea; wotɔn wieeɛ no nso, sika a wonyaeɛ no, na ɛyɛ wo dea; na adɛn enti na woyɛɛ wʼadwene sɛ wobɛyɛ deɛ woayɛ yi? Ɛnyɛ nnipa na woadi atorɔ akyerɛ wɔn, na mmom, woadi atorɔ akyerɛ Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Anania tee saa asɛm yi ara pɛ, ɔtwa hwee fam wuiɛ; na ehu kaa obiara a ɔtee saa asɛm yi no. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Wɔn mu mmeranteɛ no baeɛ bɛkyekyeree amu no firii adi kɔsiee no.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Ɛbɛyɛ nnɔnhwere mmiɛnsa akyi no, ne yere a na ɔnnim asɛm a asi no baa hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Petro bisaa no sɛ, “Wo ne wo kunu, motɔn mo asase no, sika a monyaeɛ nyinaa ara nie? Ka kyerɛ me.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Aane ne nyinaa ne no.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wo ne wo kunu penee so sɛ mobɛsɔ Onyankopɔn Honhom ahwɛ? Hwɛ! Nnipa a wɔkɔsiee wo kunu no gyina ɛpono yi akyi, na saa ara na wo nso, wɔbɛsoa wo akɔsie wo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔtwa hwee Petro anim wuiɛ. Mmeranteɛ no bɛhunuu sɛ wawu no, wɔsoaa no, kɔsiee no wɔ ne kunu nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Ehu kɛseɛ bɔɔ asafo no nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔtee saa asɛm yi no.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomafoɔ No Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Na asomafoɔ no taa hyia wɔ asɔredan no fa baabi a wɔfrɛ no “Salomo Abrannaa” so hɔ. Sɛ wɔhyia wɔ hɔ saa a, wɔyɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ pii. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Ɛwom sɛ na nnipa a wɔnka wɔn ho no di wɔn ho adanseɛ pa de, nanso wɔn mu biara antumi amfa wɔn ho ankɔbɔ asomafoɔ no ho. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Akyire no, nnipa dodoɔ a wɔgyee Awurade diiɛ no bɛkaa agyidifoɔ no ho. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Esiane anwanwadeɛ a na asomafoɔ no reyɛ no enti, wɔsoaa ayarefoɔ baa mmɔntene so de wɔn totoo mpa ne kɛtɛ so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Petro sunsum bɛtɔ wɔn mu bi so kɛkɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Nkurɔfoɔ a wɔfifiri nkuro a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no de wɔn ayarefoɔ ne wɔn a ahonhommɔne wɔ wɔn mu no baeɛ na wɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yadeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔtaa Asomafoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Ɔsɔfopanin ne nʼahokafoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ no ani beree asomafoɔ no so yie enti wɔyɛɛ adwene sɛ wɔbɛtwe wɔn aso. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Ɛno enti, wɔkyeree asomafoɔ no de wɔn kɔguu afiase. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Ɛda no ara anadwo, Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ bɛbuee afiase apono no dii asomafoɔ no anim ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Monkɔ asɔredan mu nkɔka nkwa foforɔ yi ho asɛm nkyerɛ nnipa no.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Asomafoɔ no dii asɛm a ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no so; enti, anɔpahema no wɔkɔɔ asɔredan mu hɔ hyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛeɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ɔsɔfopanin no ne nʼahokafoɔ no frɛɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin maa wɔyɛɛ nhyiamu kɛseɛ bi; afei, wɔsoma maa wɔkɔɔ afiase hɔ sɛ wɔnkɔfa asomafoɔ no mmra wɔn anim. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a nnipa no duruu afiase hɔ no, wɔanhunu asomafoɔ no; enti wɔsane ba bɛbɔɔ wɔn amaneɛ sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>“Ɛberɛ a yɛduruu afiase hɔ no, yɛhunuu sɛ wɔatoto afiase apono no nyinaa mu petee a awɛmfoɔ no gyinagyina ano. Nanso, yɛbuebuee apono no no, yɛanhunu obiara wɔ mu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔpanin a ɔhwɛ asɔredan mu awɛmfoɔ no so ne asɔfoɔ mpanin no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn adwene mu yɛɛ wɔn nnaa, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnhunu asɛm a asi.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Ankyɛre koraa na ɔbarima bi baa hɔ bɛka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Nnipa a mode wɔn guu afiase no gyinagyina asɔredan no mu rekyerɛkyerɛ nnipa no.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Awɛmfoɔ no so panin no tee asɛm yi no, ɔne ne nkurɔfoɔ no kɔkyeree asomafoɔ no de wɔn baeɛ. Awɛmfoɔ no so panin no ne awɛmfoɔ no amfa asomafoɔ no amma ɔhyɛ so, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnim sɛ, sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, nnipa no bɛsi wɔn aboɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Wɔde asomafoɔ no bɛgyinaa agyinatufoɔ no anim maa Ɔsɔfopanin no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>“Yɛhyɛɛ mo sɛ monnkyerɛkyerɛ wɔ Yesu din mu, nanso moantie. Mode mo nkyerɛkyerɛ yi afa Yerusalem baabiara, na mopɛ sɛ mokyerɛ sɛ, yɛn na yɛkumm saa ɔbarima no!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Petro ne asomafoɔ a wɔka ne ho no buaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛtie Onyankopɔn na ɛnyɛ nnipa, <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>ɛfiri sɛ, mobɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu, kumm no no, yɛn agyanom Onyankopɔn nyanee no firii owuo mu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ no animuonyam de no tenaa ne nsa nifa so sɛ Ɔhene ne Agyenkwa a ɛnam so bɛma Israelfoɔ asakyera wɔn adwene na wɔde wɔn bɔne akyɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Yɛne Honhom Kronkron a ɛyɛ akyɛdeɛ a Awurade de ma wɔn a wɔtie no no di yei ho adanseɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Agyinatufoɔ no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn bo fuiɛ na wɔkaa sɛ wɔbɛkum asomafoɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Nanso, wɔn mu baako a wɔfrɛ no Gamaliel a ɔyɛ Farisini na ɔsane yɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a na nnipa bu no no, sɔre gyina hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa asomafoɔ no mfiri adi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Afei, ɔkasa kyerɛɛ agyinatufoɔ no sɛ, “Me nuanom Israel mmarima, monnwene deɛ mopɛ sɛ moyɛ saa nnipa yi no ho yie. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Ɛnkyɛree biara na ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Teuda sɔre, kaa sɛ ɔyɛ onipa titire bi maa nnipa bɛyɛ ahanan tu dii nʼakyi. Nanso, wɔkumm no ma nʼakyidifoɔ no nyinaa bɔ hweteeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Nʼakyi no, Yuda a ɔfiri Galilea nso sɔree nnipakanberɛ no mu. Ɔno nso nnipa pii dii nʼakyi. Saa ara na ɔno nso wɔkumm no ma nʼakyidifoɔ no bɔ hweteeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Ɛno enti metu mo fo sɛ, monnyaa saa nnipa yi ma wɔnkɔ wɔn baabi. Sɛ wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ ne wɔn nnwuma yi firi onipa a, ɛbɛgu. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Nanso, sɛ ɛfiri Onyankopɔn a morentumi nsi wɔn kwan. Mobɛhunu sɛ moreko atia Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Agyinatufoɔ no tiee Gamaliel afotuo no. Wɔmaa wɔde asomafoɔ no baeɛ maa wɔbɔɔ wɔn mmaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudafoɔ asotwe a ɛyɛ mmaabɔ aduanan a wɔayi so baako na wɔde hwee wɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2 Ko 11.24</ref></char>).</char></note> hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmmmɔ Yesu din mfa nkyerɛkyerɛ bio. Afei wɔgyaa wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Esiane sɛ asomafoɔ no hunuu sɛ ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhunu amane wɔ Yesu din mu no enti, wɔde anigyeɛ na wɔfirii asɛnniiɛ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Wɔannyae Yesu Kristo ho asɛm pa no ka ne nkyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔrefie ne afie mu da.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔyi Asafo No Mu Asomfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ɛberɛ bi akyi a na asuafoɔ no redɔɔso no, akasakasa sii Hebrifoɔ a wɔka Arameike ne Hebrifoɔ a wɔka Griik kasa no ntam. Na Hebrifoɔ a wɔka Griik no no asɛm ne sɛ, Hebrifoɔ a wɔka Arameike no nhwɛ wɔn akunafoɔ yie. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Enti, asomafoɔ dumienu no frɛɛ asuafoɔ no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛgyae Onyankopɔn asɛnka kɔkyɛ aduane. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Enti, anuanom, monyi mo mu nnipa baason a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ wɔn ma na wɔnim nyansa na wɔahwɛ aka saa asɛm no. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Yɛn ankasa de, yɛde yɛn adagyeɛ nyinaa bɛbɔ mpaeɛ aka Asɛmpa no.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Nnipa no nyinaa penee adwene a asomafoɔ no de baeɛ no so. Enti, wɔyii Stefano a na gyidie ne Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma no, ne Filipo, Prokoro, Nikanor, Timon, Pamina ne Nikolao a ɔfiri Antiokia a na ɔwɔ Yudasom no mu. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Wɔde saa nnipa yi kyerɛɛ asuafoɔ no maa wɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ de wɔn nsa guu wɔn so.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Nnipa pii gyee asɛm no diiɛ maa wɔn mu dodoɔ no ara bɛkaa wɔn ho. Yudafoɔ no mu pii nso gyee wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ no diiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Stefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Stefano a Onyankopɔn adom ne tumi ahyɛ no ma no yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ bebree wɔ asafo no mu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Nanso, da koro bi nnipa bi a wɔfiri Yudafoɔ hyiadan bi a wɔfrɛ no “Ahofadifoɔ Hyiadan” no mu a wɔyɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔfiri Kirene ne Aleksandria ne wɔn a wɔfiri Kilikia ne Asia no ne Stefano gyee akyinnyeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Nanso, Honhom no maa Stefano nyansa maa ɔde kasaeɛ a obiara antumi anka hwee.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Ɛno enti wɔka hyɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ bi ano sɛ, “Yɛtee sɛ ɔreka abususɛm atia Mose ne Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Wɔnam saa ɛkwan yi so maa nnipa no ne mpanin no ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no sɔre tiaa Stefano. Wɔbɛkyeree Stefano de no kɔɔ badwafoɔ anim. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Afei, wɔde nnipa ba bɛdii adansekurumu tiaa Stefano sɛ, “Daa, saa onipa yi ka abususɛm tia yɛn asɔredan kronkron no ne Mose Mmara no. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Yɛtee mpo sɛ ɔreka sɛ, saa Yesu Nasareni no bɛdwiri yɛn asɔredan no agu na wasesa yɛn amanneɛ a Mose de maa yɛn no!”<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Nnipa a na wɔte badwa mu hɔ no nyinaa hwɛɛ Stefano anim, na wɔhunuiɛ sɛ nʼanim ayɛ te sɛ ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ anim.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Stefano Yi Ne Ho Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no bisaa Stefano sɛ, “Nsɛm a wɔaka agu wo so no nyinaa yɛ nokorɛ anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Stefano buaa sɛ, “Anuanom ne agyanom, montie me! Ansa na yɛn agya Abraham rebɛfiri Mesopotamia akɔtena Haran no, Onyankopɔn daa nʼanimuonyam adi kyerɛɛ no, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Firi wʼabusuafoɔ nkyɛn ne wʼasase so kɔ baabi a mɛkyerɛ wo no.’<verse eid="ACT 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>“Enti, ɔfirii Kaldea asase so kɔtenaa Haran. Abraham agya wuo akyi no, Onyankopɔn maa ɔbɛtenaa asase a mote so seesei yi so. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Onyankopɔn amfa asase no fa baabiara ankyɛ Abraham sɛ nʼankasa dea. Nanso, Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ no bɔ sɛ ɛbɛyɛ ɔne nʼasefoɔ nyinaa dea. Ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ Abraham bɔ yi no, na ɔnni mma. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Abraham sɛ, ‘Wʼasefoɔ bɛtena ananafoɔ asase so ayɛ nkoa wɔ hɔ na wɔayɛ wɔn ayayadeɛ mfeɛ ahanan. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Na mɛtwe ɔman a wɔbɛsom wɔn no aso; na ɛno akyi wɔbɛfiri saa ɔman no mu abɛsom me wɔ ha.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Onyankopɔn ne Abraham yɛɛ apam na wɔde twetiatwa yɛɛ apam no ho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ. Yei enti, wɔwoo Isak nnawɔtwe akyi no, wɔtwaa no twetia; Isak nso twaa Yakob twetia, saa ara nso na Yakob twitwaa agyanom mpanin dumienu no twetia.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>“Agyanom mpanin no ani beree Yosef enti wɔtɔn no maa ɔkɔyɛɛ akoa wɔ Misraim. Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ na Onyankopɔn wɔ nʼafa enti, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>ɔyii no firii ne haw nyinaa mu. Ɛberɛ a Yosef bɛpuee Misraimhene Farao anim no, Onyankopɔn dom no ahobrɛaseɛ ne nyansa. Yei maa Farao yɛɛ Yosef ɔman no so amrado ne ahemfie hɔ sohwɛfoɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no mu, ɛkɔm kɛseɛ ne ahohia sii Misraim ne Kanaan asase nyinaa so a na yɛn agyanom nnya aduane mpo nni. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Enti, ɛberɛ a Yakob tee sɛ aduane wɔ Misraim no, ɔsomaa ne mma a wɔyɛ yɛn agyanom maa wɔkɔɔ hɔ deɛ ɛdi ɛkan. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Wɔkɔɔ ne mprenu so no, Yosef daa ne ho adi kyerɛɛ ne nuanom, na ɛnam so maa Farao hunuu Yosef abusuafoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Yosef kraa nʼagya Yakob sɛ ɔne nʼabusuafoɔ nyinaa mmra Misraim. Na wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ aduɔson enum. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Afei Yakob kɔtenaa Misraim na ɛhɔ na ɔne yɛn agyanom nyinaa wuwuiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Wɔde wɔn amu no kɔɔ Sekem kɔsiee wɔn wɔ Abraham asieeɛ bi a ɔtɔ firii Hamor abusua mu no mu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>“Ɛbɔ a Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ Abraham no berɛ reduru no, na yɛn nkurɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ Misraim no ase atrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Akyire no, ɔhene foforɔ bi bɛdii adeɛ wɔ Misraim a na ɔnnim Yosef ho asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Saa ɔhene yi de atirimuɔden dii yɛn agyanom so, hyɛɛ wɔn maa wɔtotoo wɔn mma guiɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛwuwu.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>“Saa ɛberɛ yi mu na wɔwoo Mose a na ɔkura Onyankopɔn animuonyam no. Wɔhwɛɛ no wɔ nʼagya efie abosome mmiɛnsa, <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>na wɔyii no firii hɔ no, Farao babaa kɔfaa no de no baa ne fie hwɛɛ no sɛ nʼankasa ne ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Wɔtetee no Misraimfoɔ nimdeɛ mu maa ɔyɛɛ den wɔ ɔkasa ne nneyɛeɛ mu.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>“Mose dii mfeɛ aduanan no, ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔrekɔsra ne nuanom Israelfoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ Misraimni bi resisi ne nuanom mu baako bi. Mose kɔboaa ne nua no ma Mose kumm Misraimni no. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Mose susuu sɛ nʼankasa nkurɔfoɔ bɛhunuu sɛ Onyankopɔn nam ne so bɛma wɔade wɔn ho, nanso wɔante aseɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔhunuu sɛ Israelfoɔ baanu bi reko enti ɔkɔɔ hɔ sɛ ɔrekɔpata. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na moatwa mo ho reko? Monnim sɛ moyɛ anuanom anaa?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>“Deɛ ɔresisi ne yɔnko no sum Mose bisaa no sɛ, ‘Hwan na ɔyɛɛ wo yɛn so panin ne ɔtemmufoɔ? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Wopɛ sɛ wokum me sɛdeɛ nnora wokumm Misraimni no anaa?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔtu firii Misraim kɔtenaa Midian asase so. Ɛhɔ na ɔwoo mmammarima baanu.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>“Mfeɛ aduanan akyi no, ɔbɔfoɔ bi nam wira bi gyaframa mu yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ Mose wɔ ɛserɛ bi a ɛbɛn bepɔ Sinai no so. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Deɛ Mose hunuiɛ no maa ne ho dwirii no enti ɔtwe bɛn ho pɛɛ sɛ ɔhwɛ no yie. Ɔtee Awurade nne sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‘Mene wo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob Onyankopɔn.’ Ehu kaa Mose enti wantumi anhwɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>“Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, ‘Worɔ wɔ mpaboa, ɛfiri sɛ, faako a wogyina no yɛ asase kronkron. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Mahwɛ na mahunu atirimuɔden a wɔde yɛ me manfoɔ a wɔwɔ Misraim no. Mate apinie a wɔresi no nyinaa na maba sɛ merebɛgye wɔn. Yɛ ntɛm na mensoma wo nkɔ Misraim.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>“Saa Mose yi ne obi a Israelfoɔ poo no ɛberɛ a wɔbisaa no sɛ, ‘Hwan na ɔyɛɛ wo yɛn so panin ne ɔtemmufoɔ no?’ Ɔno na Onyankopɔn nam ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no wɔ wira a ɛrehyeɛ no gyaframa mu no, yɛɛ no ɔpanin ne ɔgyefoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Ɔno na ɔnam anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ so yii Israelfoɔ firii Misraim de wɔn twaa Po Kɔkɔɔ no dii wɔn anim wɔ ɛserɛ so mfeɛ aduanan no.<verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>“Mose yi ara na ɔka kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ sɛ, sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn somaa me no, saa ara na ɔbɛyi odiyifoɔ a ɔte sɛ me afiri mo mu aba mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Ɔno ne obi a ɔne Israelfoɔ yɛɛ nhyiamu wɔ ɛserɛ no so hɔ; ɔne yɛn agyanom ne ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔkasa kyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ Sinai Bepɔ no so no, na na saa ɛberɛ no wɔwɔ hɔ. Ne nsa kaa Onyankopɔn asɛm a nkwa wɔ mu no de brɛɛ yɛn.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>“Nanso, yɛn agyanom antie no. Wɔpoo no pɛɛ sɛ wɔsane kɔ Misraim asase so bio. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Enti, wɔka kyerɛɛ Aaron, sɛ, ‘Yɛ ahoni bi a wɔbɛdi yɛn anim ma yɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛnnim asɛm a ato saa Mose a ɔyii yɛn firii Misraim asase so no!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Wɔyɛɛ nantwie ba sɛso ohoni bi bɔɔ afɔdeɛ maa no, gyee wɔn ani sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Onyankopɔn twee ne ho firii wɔn ho ma wɔsomm ɔsoro nsoromma sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ adiyifoɔ nwoma mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Israelfoɔ, ɛnyɛ me na mode afɔrebɔdeɛ ne ayɛyɛdeɛ brɛɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">mfeɛ aduanan wɔ ɛserɛ so anaa?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Mode mo ho nyinaa ato Molek nyame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ne mo honi Rɛfan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">wɔyɛ ahoni a moayɛ sɛ mobɛsom wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Saa enti, mɛpam mo makɔgu Babilonia akyi.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no na ntomadan a ɛdi adanseɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn ka ne manfoɔ ho no ka yɛn agyanom ho wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ. Mose sii ntomadan yi sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsi no no ara pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Akyire yi, yɛn agyanom a Yosua dii wɔn anim no de ntomadan no baa asase a Onyankopɔn pamoo so nnipa de maa wɔn no so. Ɛsii hɔ ara kɔsii Dawid ɛberɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Onyankopɔn hyiraa Dawid enti ɔbisaa Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔmma ɔnsi asɔredan mma Yakob Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Nanso, Salomo na ɔsii dan no maa Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>“Nanso, ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn nte ɛdan a nnipa asi mu, sɛdeɛ odiyifoɔ no ka sɛ,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>“ ‘Ɔsoro yɛ mʼahennwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">na asase yɛ me nan ntiasoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ɛdan bɛn na wobɛsi ama me?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Awurade na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Wobɛtumi asi ahomegyebea ama me?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Ɛnyɛ mʼankasa na meyɛɛ yeinom nyinaa?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>“Mo asoɔdenfoɔ, mo a mo akoma apirim na montie Onyankopɔn asɛm. Mote sɛ mo agyanom pɛpɛɛpɛ. Mo nso, daa mosi Honhom Kronkron no ho kwan. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Odiyifoɔ bi wɔ hɔ a mo agyanom antaa no anaa? Wɔkumm Onyankopɔn asomafoɔ a wɔdii ɛkan bɔɔ ɔteneneeni a ɔbɛba no ho dawuro. Saa ara nso na moapa no, akum no. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Mo ara ne nnipa a monam abɔfoɔ so nyaa Onyankopɔn mmara no, nanso moanni so.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsi Stefano Aboɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Agyinatufoɔ no tee asɛm a Stefano kaeɛ no, wɔn bo fuu yie. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Nanso, Stefano a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma no maa nʼani so hwɛɛ ɔsoro hunuu Onyankopɔn animuonyam ne Yesu Kristo sɛ ɔgyina Onyankopɔn nsa nifa so. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Stefano kaa sɛ, “Mehunu sɛ ɔsoro abue na Onipa Ba no gyina Onyankopɔn nsa nifa so!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Wɔteateaam de wɔn nsa sisii wɔn aso. Afei, wɔn nyinaa bɔɔ twi kɔto hyɛɛ ne so, <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>twee no kɔɔ kurotia kɔsii no aboɔ. Wɔn a wɔsii no aboɔ no yiyii wɔn ntoma de maa aberanteɛ bi a wɔfrɛ no Saulo sɛ ɔnhwɛ so.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Wɔresi Stefano aboɔ no nyinaa na ɔrebɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, “Awurade Yesu, wo nsam na mede me honhom mehyɛ!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Afei, ɔbuu nkotodwe teaam denden sɛ, “Awurade, fa wɔn bɔne kyɛ wɔn.” Ɔkaa saa wieeɛ no, ɔwuiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔtaa Agyidifoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saulo penee kum a wɔkum Stefano no so. Saa ɛda no ara, wɔtaa agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no maa wɔn nyinaa bɔ hwete kɔɔ Yudea ne Samaria nsase so maa ɛkaa asomafoɔ no nko ara. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Nyamesurofoɔ bi kɔfaa Stefano kɔsiee no. Wɔsuu no yie. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Esiane sɛ na Saulo pɛ sɛ ɔgu asafo no enti, ɔkɔɔ afie mu kɔkyekyeree agyidifoɔ mmarima ne mmaa de wɔn guu afiase.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo Ka Asɛmpa No Wɔ Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Agyidifoɔ a na wɔabɔ ahwete no kaa asɛmpa no wɔ baabiara a wɔkɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filipo kɔɔ Samaria kuro bi mu kɔkaa Agyenkwa no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipakuo no tee asɛm a Filipo reka na wɔhunuu anwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛeɛ no, wɔn nyinaa tiee no. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Ahonhommɔne de nteateam firii nnipa bebree mu. Saa ara nso na mmubuafoɔ ne mpakye nso sɔre nanteeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Yei enti, anigyeɛ baa Samaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simon Nkonyaayifoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Na ɔbarima bi te saa kuro yi mu a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ɔyɛ nkonyaayifoɔ a ɛsiane ne nkonyaayie no enti, na Samariafoɔ pii gye no di. Na ɔyɛ obi a ɔhoahoa ne ho sɛ ɔdi mu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Yei maa nnipa a wɔwɔ kuro no mu no nyinaa gyee no too mu kaa sɛ, “Saa onipa yi ne Onyankopɔn tumi a wɔfrɛ no Ɔkɛseɛ no.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Esiane ne nkonyaa a na ɔyi no enti, ɛmaa nnipa no nyinaa tu dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Ɛberɛ a saa nnipa yi gyee asɛmpa a Filipo ka faa Onyankopɔn Ahennie ne Yesu Kristo din no ho diiɛ no, wɔbɔɔ mmarima ne mmaa nyinaa asu. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simon nso gye diiɛ maa wɔbɔɔ no asu. Baabiara a Filipo kɔeɛ no, Simon dii nʼakyi. Anwanwadeɛ a ɔhunuiɛ no ma ne ho dwirii no.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Ɛberɛ a asomafoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no tee sɛ Samariafoɔ agye Onyankopɔn asɛm no adi no, wɔsomaa Petro ne Yohane kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ maa agyidifoɔ no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Honhom Kronkron bɛba wɔn so, <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>ɛfiri sɛ, saa ɛberɛ no na asu kɛkɛ na wɔnam Awurade Yesu din so abɔ. Na Honhom Kronkron nnya mmaa wɔn so. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Afei, Petro ne Yohane de wɔn nsa guguu wɔn so maa Honhom Kronkron baa wɔn so.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Simon hunuu sɛ asomafoɔ no nsa a wɔde guguu wɔn so no na ɛmaa wɔnyaa Honhom Kronkron no, ɔmaa Petro ne Yohane sika srɛɛ sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>“Momma me saa tumi yi bi na obiara a mede me nsa bɛgu no so no anya Honhom Kronkron no bi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nnome nka wo ne wo sika nyinaa, ɛfiri sɛ, wosusu sɛ wobɛtumi de sika atɔ Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ no. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Wonni kyɛfa biara wɔ yɛn dwumadie yi mu, ɛfiri sɛ, wʼakoma mu nte wɔ Onyankopɔn anim. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Nu wo ho firi wo bɔne yi ho na bɔ mpaeɛ srɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔmfa wo bɔne nkyɛ wo. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mehunu sɛ anibereɛ bɔne ahyɛ wʼakoma mu ama bɔne afa wo dommum.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simon srɛɛ Petro ne Yohane sɛ, “Mommɔ mpaeɛ mma me na saa nnome yi mu biara amma me so.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Ansa na Petro ne Yohane reduru Yerusalem no, wɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ Samaria nkuraa bebree ase.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo Ne Etiopiani No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ ka kyerɛɛ Filipo sɛ, “Sɔre siesie wo ho kɔ anafoɔ ɛkwan a ɛfiri Yerusalem kɔ Gasa no so.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Ɛberɛ a Filipo rekɔ no, ɔhyiaa Etiopiani bi a ɔyɛ Etiopiahemmaa Kandake dabeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dabeni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obi a ɔhwɛ ɔhene anaa ɔhemmaa daberɛ ne nʼahodeɛ so</char></note>. Na saa onipa yi akɔ asɔre wɔ Yerusalem a ɔte ne teaseɛnam mu resane nʼakyi akɔ efie. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Na ɔrekenkan Odiyifoɔ Yesaia nwoma no. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Honhom Kronkron ka kyerɛɛ Filipo sɛ, “Twe bɛn no.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Filipo yɛɛ ntɛm kɔɔ teaseɛnam no ho na ɔtee sɛ ɔrekenkan Odiyifoɔ Yesaia nwoma no no, ɔbisaa sɛ, “Wote deɛ worekenkan yi ase anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Dabeni no buaa no sɛ, “Mɛyɛ dɛn na mate aseɛ? Gye sɛ obi kyerɛ me aseɛ.” Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ Filipo sɛ ɔmforo mmɛtena ne nkyɛn wɔ ne teaseɛnam no mu.<verse eid="ACT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Na dabeni no rekan saa Atwerɛsɛm yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Ɔte sɛ odwammaa a wɔrekɔku no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Sɛdeɛ odwammaa yɛ dinn wɔ ne nwitwitwafoɔ anim no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">saa ara na wammue nʼano.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Nʼanimguaseɛ mu, wannya odimafoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Na hwan na ɔbɛka nʼasefoɔ ho asɛm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔyii no firii asase yi so.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Dabeni no bisaa Filipo sɛ, “Odiyifoɔ no reka ne ho asɛm anaa obi foforɔ ho asɛm?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filipo nam saa asɛm no so kaa nsɛmpa a ɛfa Yesu ho kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wɔduruu asuo bi ho. Dabeni no ka kyerɛɛ Filipo sɛ, “Nsuo nie. Ɛdeɛn na ɛsi wo kwan sɛ wobɔ me asu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filipo ka kyerɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wofiri wʼakoma mu gye di a, mɛbɔ wo asu.” Dabeni no buaa no sɛ, “Megye di. Megye di sɛ Yesu Kristo yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Dabeni no hyɛ maa teaseɛnam no gyinaeɛ. Ɔne Filipo kɔɔ nsuo no ho maa ɔbɔɔ no asu. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Wɔfiri nsuo no mu no, Onyankopɔn Honhom hwim Filipo firii dabeni no nkyɛn kɔeɛ. Wanhunu Filipo bio de, nanso ɔde anigyeɛ toaa nʼakwantuo no so. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filipo kɔpuee Asoto kɔɔ so kaa asɛmpa no wɔ nkuro no mu kɔsii sɛ ɔkɔduruu Kaesarea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Saulo Adwensakra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Saulo ani abere sɛ ɔbɛtɔre Kristo akyidifoɔ no ase. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Ɔkɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanin no nkyɛn kɔgyee adansedie krataa a ɛbɛma no tumi ama wakɔ hyiadan mu wɔ Damasko akɔkyekyere nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho, sɛ wɔyɛ mmaa anaa mmarima, na ɔde wɔn akɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Ɔreyɛ abɛn Damasko no, prɛko pɛ, hann bi firi ɔsoro twa faa ne ho, <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>maa ɔtwa hwee fam. Afei, ɔtee nne bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Saulo! Adɛn enti na wotaa me?”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Saulo bisaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ wo hwan, Owura?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Nne no buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ me Yesu a wotaa me no.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Nne no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre na kɔ kuro no mu na wɔbɛkyerɛ wo deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ woyɛ.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Nnipa a wɔne Saulo nam no gyinaeɛ a wɔantumi anka hwee; wɔtee nne no, nanso wɔanhunu obiara. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Afei, Saulo sɔre firii fam hɔ buee nʼani, nanso na ɔnhunu adeɛ. Enti, wɔkurakura no nkakrankakra de no kɔɔ Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Nnansa a ɔdii wɔ Damasko no na ɔnhunu hwee. Na ɔnnidi na ɔnnom nso.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Na osuani bi wɔ Damasko a wɔfrɛ no Anania. Awurade frɛɛ no anisoadehunu mu sɛ, <char style="wj">“Anania!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Ɔgyee so sɛ, “Awurade!”<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Awurade ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ Yuda efie a ɛwɔ Tempɔn Tee no so na kɔbisa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Saulo a ɔfiri Tarso no ase; ɔrebɔ mpaeɛ.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/><char style="wj">Anisoadehunu mu, ɔhunuu ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Anania a ɔde ne nsa too ne so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛsane ahunu adeɛ.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Anania buaa sɛ, “Awurade, mate saa ɔbarima yi ho nsɛm bebree, ne ha a ɔha wʼakyidifoɔ wɔ Yerusalem no. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Wakɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin nkyɛn akɔgye adansedie krataa a ɛbɛma no tumi na ɔde akyere obiara a ɔbɔ wo din wɔ ha no.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Anania sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ! Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno na mayi no a menam ne so bɛma amanamanmufoɔ ne ahemfo ne Israelfoɔ nyinaa ate me din.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/><char style="wj">Na mɛkyerɛ no amaneɛ a ɛsiane me din enti ɔbɛhunu.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Afei, Anania kɔɔ efie hɔ de ne nsa guu Saulo so kaa sɛ, “Onua Saulo, Awurade Yesu no ankasa a ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wo ɛkwan so ɛberɛ a woreba no asoma me sɛ, memmɛbue wʼani na hunu adeɛ, na Honhom Kronkron nhyɛ wo ma.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Amonom hɔ ara, biribi a ɛte sɛ abon firii nʼani so na ɔhunuu adeɛ. Ɔsɔre maa wɔbɔɔ no asu. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Ɔnyaa aduane bi di meeɛ no, ne ho sanee no. Saulo dii nna kakra wɔ asuafoɔ a na wɔwɔ Damasko no nkyɛn.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo Ka Asɛmpa No Wɔ Damasko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kaa asɛmpa no wɔ hyiadan mu sɛ, Yesu yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba ampa. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Nnipa a wɔtee asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn maa wɔbisaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ saa ɔbarima yi na na ɔkum wɔn a wɔbɔ saa din yi wɔ Yerusalem no anaa? Na yɛate sɛ ɔbaa ha sɛ ɔrebɛkyere wɔn a wɔbɔ saa din yi nyinaa de wɔn akɔma asɔfoɔ mpanin.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Saulo asɛnka no mu yɛɛ den; nnipa no gyee nsɛm a ɔka faa Yesu ho sɛ ɔno ne Agyenkwa no diiɛ. Yudafoɔ a wɔte Damasko no antumi anka nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ no ho hwee.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Nna bi akyi no, Yudafoɔ no bɔɔ Saulo ho pɔ sɛ wɔbɛkum no, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>nanso Saulo tee pɔ a wɔbɔɔ wɔ ne ho no. Na wɔtetɛ no wɔ kuro no apono ano awia ne anadwo apɛ no akum no. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Anadwo bi Saulo akyidifoɔ de no sii kɛntɛn bi mu, twetwee no faa ɔfasuo so gyaa no sii fam.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Saulo kɔɔ Yerusalem no, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔde ne ho kɔbɔ asuafoɔ no ho nanso wɔsuroo no, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnnye nni sɛ wasakyera abɛyɛ osuani. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Barnaba kɔfaa no kɔɔ asuafoɔ no nkyɛn. Ɔkaa wɔn sɛdeɛ Awurade yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ Saulo na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ no wɔ Damasko ɛkwan so no ne sɛdeɛ ɔde akokoɔduru kaa Yesu ho asɛm wɔ Damasko no. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Saulo ne wɔn tenaeɛ na ɔde akokoɔduru kaa Awurade asɛm no wɔ Yerusalem nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Saulo ne Helenifoɔ nyaa akasakasa enti wɔbɔɔ pɔ sɛ wɔbɛkum no. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Ɛberɛ a agyidifoɔ no tee pɔ a Helenifoɔ no bɔɔ wɔ Saulo ho no, wɔde no kɔɔ Kaesarea gyaa no ɛkwan ma ɔkɔɔ Tarso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Afei, asafo a wɔwɔ Yudea, Samaria ne Galilea no nyinaa asom dwoo wɔn. Asafo no nam Honhom Kronkron so timiiɛ. Nnipa pii bɛkaa wɔn ho na wɔtenaa ase wɔ Awurade suro mu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Petro tutuu akwan kɔɔ mmeammea. Ɛda bi, ɔkɔsraa agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ Lida no, <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>ɔhyiaa ɔbarima bi a ne din de Enea a wabubu agu kɛtɛ so mfeɛ nnwɔtwe wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Enea, Awurade Yesu Kristo nsa wo yadeɛ. Sɔre na yi wo kɛtɛ!” Amonom hɔ ara, Enea sɔree. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Nnipa a wɔte Lida ne Saron no nyinaa hunuu no no, wɔde wɔn ho maa Awurade.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Na ɔbaa ogyedini bi te Yopa a ne din de Tabita a ne nkyerɛaseɛ ne Dorka a aseɛ ne ɔwansane. Saa ɔbaa yi de nʼadagyeɛ nyinaa yɛɛ papa, boaa ahiafoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Saa ɛberɛ korɔ yi ara mu na yadeɛ bɔɔ no maa ɔwuiɛ. Wɔdwaree no<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amanneɛ bi a na Yudafoɔ ne Helafoɔ nyinaa di so ne sɛ wɔdware funu ansa na wɔsie no.</char></note> de no kɔtoo abansoro dan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ wɔantumi ansie owufoɔ ntɛm a, amanneɛ ne sɛ wɔdeda no abansoro. Yerusalem de, da a obi bɛwu no ara na wɔsie no. Sɛ ɛnyɛ Yerusalem a, wɔtumi sie owufoɔ no ne nnansa so.</char></note> bi mu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Esiane sɛ Lida bɛn Yopa no enti, asuafoɔ a wɔwɔ Yopa no tee sɛ Petro wɔ Lida no, wɔsomaa mmarima baanu kɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ ntɛm mmra.<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Petro yɛɛ ntɛm ne wɔn kɔeɛ. Ɔduruu hɔ no, wɔde no kɔɔ abansoro dan no mu. Akunafoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa bɛgyinagyinaa Petro ho suiɛ de ntadeɛ ne ntoma a Tabita te ase no ɔpam maa wɔn no kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="ACT 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Petro maa wɔn nyinaa firii adi. Afei, ɔbuu nkotodwe, bɔɔ mpaeɛ danee nʼani kyerɛɛ amu no kaa sɛ, “Tabita, sɔre!” Tabita tee nʼani na ɔhunuu Petro no, ɔsɔre tenaa ase. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Petro sɔɔ ne nsa ma ɔsɔre gyinaa hɔ. Afei, Petro frɛɛ agyidifoɔ no ne akunafoɔ no nyinaa de no maa wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Saa asɛm yi trɛɛ wɔ Yopa nyinaa maa nnipa pii gyee Awurade diiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Petro tenaa Simon a ɔhyɛ mmoa nwoma aduro no nkyɛn wɔ Yopa kyɛree kakra.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Petro Ne Kornelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Ɔbarima bi tenaa Kaesarea a ne din de Kornelio. Na ɔyɛ Roma asraafoɔ bi a wɔn din de Italia Asraafodɔm no so panin. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Na ɔne ne efiefoɔ nyinaa yɛ Nyamesurofoɔ. Ɔyɛ obi nso a na ɔboa ahiafoɔ na daa ɔbɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Ɛda bi awia bɛyɛ nnɔnmiɛnsa no, ɔhunuu Onyankopɔn ɔbɔfoɔ wɔ anisoadehunu mu sɛ waba ne nkyɛn abɛfrɛ no sɛ, “Kornelio!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Kornelio de hu hwɛɛ no dinn. Ɔbisaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ ɛdeɛn Awurade?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Ɔbɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Wo mpaeɛ ne wʼadɔeɛ a woyɛ ahiafoɔ no aduru Onyankopɔn anim sɛ nkaeɛ adeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Soma nnipa na wɔnkɔ Yopa nkɔfa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon Petro no mmra. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Ɔte ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ɔhyɛ mmoa nwoma aduro a ne fie bɛn mpoano no nkyɛn.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no kasa kyerɛɛ no wieeɛ a ɔkɔeɛ no, Kornelio frɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ baanu, sane frɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ no mu baako a ɔyɛ Nyamesuroni kaa wɔn ho, <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>kaa biribiara a wahunu no kyerɛɛ wɔn, somaa wɔn Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a wɔrekɔ no, ɛbɛyɛ owigyinaeɛ a wɔrebɛn kuro no no, Petro kɔɔ ɛdan a ɔte mu no atifi kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, ɛkɔm dee no; na wɔgu so reyɛ aduane ama no no, ɔkɔɔ tebea bi a ɛte sɛ adaeɛso mu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Ɔhunuu sɛ ɔsoro abue, na biribi a ɛte sɛ ntoma kɛseɛ a wɔakyekyere nʼafannan firi ɔsoro resiane ba fam. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Na ntɔteboa ahodoɔ ne mmoa a wɔwea ne wiram nnomaa ahyɛ saa ntoma no ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Afei, nne bi ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Petro, sɔre na kum bi we!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Petro buaa sɛ, “Dabi, Awurade, mennii biribiara a ɛho nteɛ da.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Nne no ka kyerɛɛ no bio sɛ, “Biribiara a Onyankopɔn ate ho no, nka sɛ ɛho nte.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Saa anisoadehunu yi baa mprɛnsa. Afei, ntoma no sane kɔɔ soro.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Saa ɛberɛ a na Petro redwennwene anisoadehunu no ho no, nnipa a Kornelio somaa wɔn no kɔduruu Petro aboboano. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Wɔfrɛ bisaeɛ sɛ, “Saa efie yi mu na Simon Petro te no anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Petro gu so redwennwene anisoadehunu no ho no, Honhom Kronkron ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Simon, mmarima baasa bi rehwehwɛ wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Siane si fam. Ntwentwɛn wo nan ase na wo ne wɔn nkɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, me na masoma wɔn.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Petro siane kɔɔ fam kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mene onipa a morehwehwɛ no no, na mo amaneɛ?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Nnipa no buaa no sɛ, “Yɛfiri asraafoɔ panin Kornelio nkyɛn. Ɔyɛ ɔteneneeni ne Onyamesuroni a Yudafoɔ nyinaa bu no. Onyankopɔn ɔbɔfoɔ ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsoma mfrɛ wo mmra ne fie na ɔntie asɛm bi mfiri wo nkyɛn.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Petro gyee nnipa no, somm wɔn hɔhoɔ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Petro Kɔ Kornelio Efie</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Petro ne nnipa no ne agyidifoɔ bi a wɔfiri Yopa bɔɔ anan kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a ɔduruu Kaesarea no, na Kornelio afrɛfrɛ nʼabusuafoɔ ne ne nnamfonom ahyia retwɛn no. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Petro reyɛ awura efie hɔ no, Kornelio hyiaa no, buu no nkotodwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Nanso, Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɔre, ɛfiri sɛ, me nso meyɛ onipa sɛ wo ara.”<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Petro ne Kornelio gu so rekasa no, wɔwuraa efie no mu kɔtoo nnipa bebree. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mo ara monim pefee sɛ Yudafoɔ mmara mma Yudani ɛkwan sɛ ɔkɔsra Amanamamuni anaasɛ ɔde ne ho bɔ no. Nanso, Onyankopɔn akyerɛ me sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ meka sɛ onipa bi ho nte. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Yei enti na mosoma bɛfrɛɛ me no mantwentwɛn me nan ase no. Afei, kyerɛ me deɛ enti a wosoma bɛfrɛɛ me no.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Kornelio kaa sɛ, “Ɛnnɛ ne nna ɛnan awia nnɔnmiɛnsa a merebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ me fie no, mehunuu sɛ ɔbarima bi a ɔhyɛ atadeɛ a ɛhyerɛn gyina mʼanim. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Kornelio, wo mpaeɛbɔ ne wʼadɔeɛ a woyɛ ahiafoɔ no aduru Onyankopɔn anim sɛ nkaeɛ adeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Soma nnipa na wɔnkɔ Yopa nkɔfa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon Petro no mmra. Ɔte ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ɔhyɛ mmoa nwoma aduro a ne fie bɛn mpoano no nkyɛn’. <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Mesoma maa wɔbɛfrɛɛ wo, na wo nso woayɛ adeɛ sɛ woaba. Seesei, yɛn nyinaa ahyia wɔ Onyankopɔn din mu rebɛtie asɛm biara a Awurade ahyɛ wo sɛ ka kyerɛ yɛn no.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Petro firii aseɛ kasaa sɛ, “Afei, mahunu sɛ, ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn nyɛ nyiyimu, <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>na mmom, ɔman biara mu, deɛ ɔyɛ ade tenenee no, ɔgye no. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Monim asɛmpa a ɛfa asomdwoeɛ ho a ɛnam yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo a ɔyɛ nnipa nyinaa Awurade no so de brɛɛ Israelfoɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Monim nsɛm a ɛsisii wɔ Yudea, a ɛfirii aseɛ wɔ Galilea, Yohane asubɔ ho asɛnka no akyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Monim sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn de Honhom Kronkron ne tumi maa Yesu Nasareni no. Esiane sɛ Onyankopɔn ka ne ho no enti, ɔkɔɔ mmeammea, yɛɛ papa, saa wɔn a ɔbonsam afa wɔn no yadeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>“Yɛyɛ dwuma a ɔdii wɔ Yudaman mu ne Yerusalem no ho adansefoɔ. Wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu, kumm no. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Nanso, ne nnansa so no, Onyankopɔn maa ɔsɔre firii awufoɔ mu maa ɔkɔyii ne ho adi. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Wanyi ne ho adi ankyerɛ nnipa nyinaa sɛ yɛn a yɛyɛ adansefoɔ a Onyankopɔn ayi yɛn dada no. Ɔsɔre firii awufoɔ mu no, yɛne no didi nomee. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Na ɔhyɛɛ yɛn sɛ, yɛnka asɛmpa no nkyerɛ nnipa nyinaa, na yɛnni ne ho adanseɛ sɛ, ɔno ne deɛ Onyankopɔn ayi no asi hɔ sɛ ɔmmu ateasefoɔ ne awufoɔ atɛn no. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Adiyifoɔ nyinaa kaa ne ho asɛm sɛ, wɔnam ne din so de obiara a ɔgye no di no bɔne bɛkyɛ no.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanamanmufoɔ Nya Honhom Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Petro gu so rekasa no, Honhom Kronkron baa wɔn a wɔretie asɛm no nyinaa so. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Yudafoɔ agyidifoɔ a wɔne Petro firi Yopa baeɛ no ho dwirii wɔn sɛ Onyankopɔn ahwie nʼakyɛdeɛ a ɛyɛ Honhom Kronkron no agu amanamanmufoɔ no nso so. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔtee sɛ wɔreka kasa foforɔ reyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ wɔ ne kɛseyɛ ho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Petro kaa sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>“Saa nnipa yi anya Honhom Kronkron sɛdeɛ yɛn nso yɛnyaa bi no. Obi bɛtumi asi wɔn asubɔ ho ɛkwan anaa?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Petro hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ wɔn asu Yesu Kristo din mu. Afei, wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔnni nna kakra wɔ wɔn nkyɛn.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Petro Yi Ne Ho Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Asomafoɔ ne agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ Yudea nyinaa tee sɛ amanamanmufoɔ no nso agye Onyankopɔn asɛm no adi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Petro kɔɔ Yerusalem no, Yudafoɔ agyidifoɔ no ne no nyaa akasakasa kaa sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>“Woakɔ wɔn a wɔnnyɛ twetiatwafoɔ no nkyɛn ne wɔn akɔdidi.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Petro bɔɔ wɔn biribiara a ɛsii no ho amaneɛ sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>“Na merebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ Yopa na menyaa anisoadehunu. Mehunuu biribi a ɛte sɛ ntoma kɛseɛ a wɔakyekyere nʼafannan sɛ ɛfiri ɔsoro resiane ba fam reba abɛsi me ho. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Mehwɛɛ mu no, mehunuu ntɔteboa ahodoɔ, mmoa a wɔwea ne wiram nnomaa. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Afei, nne bi ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Petro! Sɔre! Kum na we!’</char><verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>“Mebuaa sɛ, ‘Dabi, Awurade! Mennii biribiara a ɛho nteɛ da.’<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>“Ɛnne no ka kyerɛɛ me bio sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Biribiara a Onyankopɔn ate ho no, nka sɛ ɛho nte.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Saa anisoadehunu yi baa mprɛnsa, na ɛsane kɔɔ ɔsoro.<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, nnipa baasa a wɔasoma wɔn firi Kaesarea no bɛduruu efie a na mete mu no mu. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Honhom Kronkron ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, menntwentwɛn me nan ase na me ne wɔn nkɔ. Saa agyidifoɔ baasa yi a wɔfiri Yopa no kaa me ho kɔɔ Kaesarea maa yɛn nyinaa kɔɔ Kornelio efie. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Ɔkaa sɛdeɛ ɔhunuu ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ wɔ ne fie maa ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Soma kɔ Yopa kɔfrɛ ɔbarima bi a ne din de Simon Petro no. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Ɔno na ɔbɛka nsɛm a ɛbɛgye wo ne wo fiefoɔ nyinaa nkwa akyerɛ mo.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>“Ɛberɛ a mehyɛɛ aseɛ kasaeɛ no, Honhom Kronkron baa wɔn so sɛdeɛ yɛn nso ahyɛaseɛ no, ɛbaa yɛn so no ara pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ɛhɔ ara mekaee asɛm a Awurade kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Yohane de nsuo na ɛbɔɔ asu na mo de, wɔde Honhom Kronkron na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu’</char> no. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn ama wɔn akyɛdeɛ a ɛberɛ a yɛgyee Awurade Yesu Kristo diiɛ no ɔmaa yɛn bi no a, ɛnneɛ me sɛɛ ne hwan a mɛsi Onyankopɔn kwan.”<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Wɔtee saa asɛm yi no, wɔgyaee wɔn nsɛmmisa no yii Awurade ayɛ sɛ, “Afei, deɛ Onyankopɔn ama ho kwan ama amanamanmufoɔ anya adwensakyera a ɛde wɔn bɛkɔ nkwagyeɛ mu.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Antiokia Asafo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Wɔkumm Stefano no, wɔtaa agyidifoɔ no maa wɔbɔ hweteeɛ, Wɔn mu bi kyinkyini kɔduruu Foinike, ne Kipro, ne Antiokia a na wɔreka asɛmpa no kyerɛ Yudafoɔ nko ara. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Agyidifoɔ bi a wɔfiri Kipro ne Kirene kɔɔ Antiokia kɔkaa asɛmpa a ɛfa Awurade Yesu Kristo ho no kyerɛɛ amanamanmufoɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Esiane sɛ na Awurade ka wɔn ho no enti, nnipa pii gyee asɛm no diiɛ maa wɔdane baa Awurade nkyɛn.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Saa asɛm yi trɛ kɔduruu Yerusalem asafo no mu enti, wɔsomaa Barnaba kɔɔ Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Ɔduruu hɔ a ɔhunuu sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn ahyira wɔn no, nʼani gyeeɛ maa ɔhyɛɛ wɔn nkuran sɛ, wɔmfiri wɔn akoma nyinaa mu nnye Awurade nni na wɔnni no nokorɛ nso. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Esiane sɛ na Barnaba yɛ onipa pa a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma na ɔwɔ gyidie enti, ɛmaa nnipa bebree nam ne so de wɔn ho maa Awurade.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Barnaba kɔɔ Tarso kɔhwehwɛɛ Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Ɔhunuu no no, ɔde no baa Antiokia. Wɔn baanu tenaa hɔ afe, kyerɛkyerɛɛ nnipa bebree. Antiokia ha na wɔtoo asuafoɔ no din sɛ “Akristofoɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Saa ɛberɛ korɔ yi ara mu, adiyifoɔ bi firi Yerusalem kɔɔ Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Wɔn mu baako a wɔfrɛ no Agabo a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma no sɔre gyina hyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ, ɛkɔm kɛseɛ bɛba asase nyinaa so. Saa ɛkɔm yi sii ɛberɛ a na Klaudio di adeɛ no. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Asuafoɔ no yɛɛ adwene sɛ biribiara a obi wɔ no wɔde bɛba na wɔde akɔboa anuanom a wɔwɔ Yudea no. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Akyɛdeɛ a wɔn nsa kaeɛ no, wɔde somaa Barnaba ne Saulo maa wɔde kɔmaa asafo no mu mpanimfoɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔtaa Asomafoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi mu ara na Ɔhene Herode kyekyeree asafomma no bi hyɛɛ aseɛ yɛɛ wɔn ayayadeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Ɔde akofena kumm Yohane nua Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Ɔhunuu sɛ Yudafoɔ no ani gye deɛ ɔyɛeɛ no ho no, ɔmaa wɔkɔkyeree Petro nso. Asɛm yi sii Apiti Afahyɛ no mu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Wɔkyeree Petro no, wɔde no too afiase a na asraafoɔ baanan na wɔwɛn no ɛberɛ biara. Herode yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ, Twam Afahyɛ no akyi, ɔbɛdi nʼasɛm wɔ ɔman no anim.<verse eid="ACT 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Ɛberɛ a na Petro da afiase no nyinaa, na asafo no bɔ mpaeɛ denden, srɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔnhwɛ ne so.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbɔfoɔ Yi Petro Firi Afiase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Anadwo a adeɛ rebɛkye ama Herode adi Petro asɛm wɔ ɔman no anim no, na Petro da asraafoɔ baanu ntam a wɔde nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mmienu agugu no asesa asraafoɔ baanu a wɔwɛn no no. Na asraafoɔ baanu nso rewɛn afiase ɛpono no ano. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Amonom hɔ ara, Onyankopɔn ɔbɔfoɔ bɛgyinaa afiase hɔ maa ɛhɔ hyerɛneeɛ. Ɔbɔfoɔ no wosoo Petro, nyanee no, ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɔre ntɛm!” Ɛhɔ ara, nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn no tete firii Petro nsa.<verse eid="ACT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, “Hyɛ wʼatadeɛ ne wo mpaboa. Petro wieeɛ no, ɔbɔfoɔ no sane ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, Fira wo ntoma na di mʼakyi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Petro dii nʼakyi firii adi. Wɔrekɔ no, na ɛyɛ no sɛ adaeɛso anaa anisoadehunu, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔnnye nni sɛ ɛyɛ asɛm pa ara. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Wɔtwaa awɛmfoɔ a wɔdi ɛkan no ne wɔn a wɔtɔ so mmienu no ho bɛduruu dadeɛ ɛpono a ɛda kuro no ano no ho. Wɔduruu hɔ no ɛpono no ankasa bue maa wɔfaa mu kɔeɛ. Wɔfaa borɔno bi so kɔɔ animu kakra, na afei ɔbɔfoɔ no gyaa Petro hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Petro ani baa ne ho so maa ɔkaa sɛ, “Afei, mahunu sɛ deɛ ɛsiiɛ no nyinaa yɛ nokorɛ! Awurade somaa ne ɔbɔfoɔ na ɔbɛgyee me firii Herode nsam ne deɛ Yudafoɔ hwehwɛɛ sɛ wɔyɛ me no mu.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Petro hunuu deɛ asi no, ɔkɔɔ Yohane a na wɔfrɛ no Marko no maame a ne din de Maria no fie. Saa ɛberɛ no, na nnipa bebree ahyia wɔ hɔ rebɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Petro bɔɔ abɔntenpono no mu, na abaayewa bi a wɔfrɛ no Roda bɛtieeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔtee nne no, anigyeɛ enti, wammue ɛpono no. Ɔsane nʼakyi kɔbɔɔ amaneɛ sɛ, “Petro gyina ɛpono no akyi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Gyama worebɔ dam.” Nanso, ɔkɔɔ so kaa sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ. Wɔn nso ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Gyama ne saman.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Petro kɔɔ so bɔɔ ɛpono no akyi. Wɔbueeɛ a wɔhunuu Petro no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Ɔde ne nsa nyamaa wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ komm. Ɔkaa ɛkwan a Awurade nam so yii no firii afiase no kyerɛɛ wɔn. Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monka asɛm a asi yi nkyerɛ Yakobo ne anuanom a wɔaka no.” Afei, ɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ baabi foforɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, awɛmfoɔ no ho yeraa wɔn yie sɛ wɔnhunu faako a Petro afa. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herode hyɛɛ sɛ wɔnhwehwɛ no, nanso wɔanhunu no. Wɔdii awɛmfoɔ no asɛm, buu wɔn kumfɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Yei akyi no, Herode firii Yudea kɔɔ Kaesarea kɔtenaa hɔ kakra. <verse eid="ACT 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Ɛberɛ a Herode wɔ Kaesarea no, abɔfoɔ bi a wɔasoma wɔn firi Tiro ne Sidon bɛhunuu no. Na Herode bo afu Tirofoɔ ne Sidonfoɔ. Nanso, abɔfoɔ yi dwane toaa Blasto a na ɔyɛ dabehene no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a asomdwoeɛ bɛba, ɛfiri sɛ, na saa nkuro yi nya wɔn nnuane nyinaa firi Herode asase so.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Wɔtuu da bi sii hɔ maa Herode penee so. Ɛda no duruiɛ no, ɔhyɛɛ nʼahentadeɛ tenaa nʼahennwa so, kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Herode kasa wieeɛ no, nnipa no kaa sɛ, “Ɔkasa sɛ onyame bi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Ɛhɔ ara Onyankopɔn ɔbɔfoɔ bɛbɔɔ no maa ɔyareeɛ. Ɔdɔree mmoa ma ɔwuiɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wamfa obuo amma Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Onyankopɔn asɛm kɔɔ so trɛ maa nnipa bebree gye diiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsoma Asɛmpatrɛ Adwumayɛfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnaba ne Saulo wiee wɔn dwumadie no, wɔsane wɔn akyi firii Yerusalem a na Yohane a wɔfrɛ no Marko no ka wɔn ho.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Adiyifoɔ ne akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a na wɔwɔ Antiokia asafo no mu bi ne Barnaba ne Simeon, a na wɔfrɛ no “Onipa Tuntum,” Lukio a ɔyɛ Kireneni, Manaen, a ɔne Ɔhene Herode yɛ atipɛnfoɔ, ne Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔresom Awurade na wɔredi mmuada no, Honhom Kronkron no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monyi Barnaba ne Saulo na wɔnkɔdi dwuma a ɛno enti mafrɛ wɔn no mma me.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Wɔdii mmuada, bɔɔ mpaeɛ, de wɔn nsa guu wɔn so, somaa wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnaba Ne Saulo Kɔ Kipro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Honhom Kronkron somaa wɔn no, wɔkɔɔ Seleukia. Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔtoaa wɔn akwantuo no so kɔduruu Kipro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Wɔduruu Salami no, wɔkaa Onyankopɔn asɛm wɔ Yudafoɔ hyiadan mu. Saa ɛberɛ no, na Yohane Marko ka wɔn ho sɛ ɔsomfoɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Wɔtwaam wɔ supɔ no so kɔduruu Pafo, na ɛhɔ na wɔhyiaa Yudani nkonyaayifoɔ bi a ɔfrɛ ne ho sɛ odiyifoɔ a na ne din de Bar-Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Na nʼadamfo ne amrado a ɔwɔ supɔ no so a ne din de Sergio Paulo no. Saa amrado a na ɔnim nyansa yie no soma ma wɔkɔfrɛɛ Barnaba ne Saulo, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔrepɛ Onyankopɔn asɛm atie. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Nanso, nkonyaayifoɔ Bar-Yesu a, Hela kasa mu wɔfrɛ no Elima no ampene so, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔmpɛ sɛ amrado yi bɛtie Onyankopɔn asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Afei, Honhom Kronkron bɛhyɛɛ Saulo a ne din de Paulo no ma maa ɔhwɛɛ nkonyaayifoɔ Elima dinn kaa sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>“Ɔbonsam ba a ɔte sɛ wo! Wommpɛ ade pa biara yie. Nnaadaa ahodoɔ ahyɛ wo ma. Ɛberɛ biara, wopɛ sɛ wodane Awurade nokwasɛm ani ma ɛyɛ nkontomposɛm! <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Awurade bɛtwe wʼaso ama wʼani afira a worenhunu adeɛ firi saa ɛberɛ yi de kɔsi berɛ bi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ɛhɔ ara Elima ani firaeɛ a na ɔde ne nsa rekeka sɛ ɔbɛnya obi asɔ ne mu anaa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Amrado no hunuu asɛm a asi no, ɔgyee Awurade asɛm no diiɛ. Awurade ho asɛm a ɔteeɛ no maa ne ho dwirii no.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomafoɔ No Kɔduru Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Paulo ne nʼahokafoɔ no tenaa ɛhyɛn mu firii Pafo kɔɔ Perge a ɛwɔ Pamfilia no; ɛhɔ na Yohane a ne din baako nso ne Marko no gyaa wɔn hɔ sane kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Wɔfiri Perge no, wɔkɔɔ Antiokia a ɛwɔ Pisidia. Ɛduruu Homeda no, wɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu kɔsomeeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Wɔkenkan Mose Mmara no ne Adiyifoɔ no nsɛm wieeɛ no, hyiadan no mu mpanimfoɔ no soma kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, sɛ mowɔ asɛm bi a mobɛka de ahyɛ nnipa no nkuran a, mowɔ ho kwan sɛ moka.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Afei, Paulo sɔre gyinaeɛ, nyamaa ne nsa hyɛɛ aseɛ kasaa sɛ, “Me nuanom Israelfoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a mowɔ ha a mosom Onyankopɔn no, montie me! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Israel Onyankopɔn yii yɛn nananom ma wɔyɛɛ ɔman kɛseɛ ɛberɛ a na wɔte Misraim asase so no. Onyankopɔn nam ne tumi kɛseɛ so yii wɔn firii Misraim, <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>na ɔhwɛɛ wɔn so wɔ ɛserɛ so mfeɛ aduanan. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Ɔsɛee amanaman nson wɔ Kanaan asase so na ɔde asase no maa ne nkurɔfoɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>maa wɔtenaa so mfeɛ ahanan ne aduonum. Yei akyi no, ɔmaa atemmufoɔ dii wɔn so kɔsii sɛ Odiyifoɔ Samuel baeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔnya ɔhene ma ɔdi wɔn so no, Onyankopɔn de Kis ba Saulo a ɔfiri Benyamin abusua mu no maa wɔn maa ɔdii wɔn so mfeɛ aduanan. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Onyankopɔn tuu Saulo adeɛ so na ɔde Dawid sii nʼanan mu. Asɛm a Onyankopɔn ka faa Dawid ho ne sɛ, ‘Mahunu sɛ Yisai ba Dawid ne onipa a mepɛ no; ɔyɛ onipa a ɔbɛyɛ deɛ mepɛ nyinaa.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>“Sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ ho bɔ no, Yesu a ɔyɛ Dawid aseni no na ɔyɛɛ no Israelfoɔ Agyenkwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Ansa na Yesu rebɛfiri nʼadwuma ase no, Yohane kaa adwensakyera ho asɛm kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ sɛ, wɔnsakyera mfiri wɔn bɔne ho na wɔmma wɔmmɔ wɔn asu. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Ansa na Yohane rebɛwie nʼasɛnka no, ɔbisaa nnipa no sɛ, ‘Mosusu sɛ meyɛ hwan? Ɛnyɛ me ne onipa a moretwɛn no no. Ɛrenkyɛre biara, deɛ moretwɛn no no bɛba, na mensɛ sɛ mɛworɔ ne mpaboa afiri ne nan.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>“Me nuanom Abraham asefoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a mosom Onyankopɔn a mowɔ ha, yɛn enti na Onyankopɔn soma maa wɔde saa nkwagyesɛm yi abrɛ yɛn. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Esiane sɛ na nnipa a na wɔte Yerusalem ne wɔn mpanimfoɔ nnim sɛ ɔno ne Agyenkwa no, na wɔnte adiyifoɔ no nsɛm a wɔkenkan no Homeda no ase no enti, wɔbuu Yesu kumfɔ, maa adiyifoɔ no nsɛm no baa mu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Ɛwom sɛ wɔannya afɔbusɛm bi annyina so ammu no kumfɔ de, nanso wɔsrɛɛ Pilato sɛ ɔnkum no. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Wɔyɛɛ biribiara a Atwerɛsɛm no ka fa ne ho wieeɛ no, wɔyii no firii asɛnnua no so kɔsiee no. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn maa ɔsɔre firii awufoɔ mu, <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>ne wusɔreɛ akyi no, na ɔtaa yi ne ho adi kyerɛ wɔn a na wɔne no tu kwan firi Galilea kɔ Yerusalem no. Wɔn ne nnipa a wɔdi ne ho adanseɛ kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>“Afei, yɛwɔ ha sɛ yɛrebɛka asɛmpa no akyerɛ mo sɛ, Onyankopɔn nam sɔre a ɔmaa Yesu Kristo sɔre firii awufoɔ mu no so ama bɔ a ɔhyɛɛ yɛn nananom no aba mu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Yei ne deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ Nnwom a ɛtɔ so mmienu mu no sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘Woyɛ me ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">ɛnnɛ, mayɛ wʼAgya.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Asɛm a Onyankopɔn ka faa sɔre a ɔmaa no sɔre firii awufoɔ mu na ɔrensane nkɔ porɔeɛ mu no ne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“ ‘Mede nhyira kronkron a mehyɛɛ Dawid ho bɔ no bɛhyira wo.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Wɔaka no baabi nso sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“ ‘Woremma wo Kronkronni no mporɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>“Dawid ɛberɛ so, ɔsomm Onyankopɔn kɔsii sɛ ɔwuiɛ ma wɔsiee no ne nananom nkyɛn pɛɛ, na ɔporɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Nanso, deɛ Onyankopɔn nyanee no firii awufoɔ mu no amporɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>“Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ mo nyinaa te aseɛ sɛ, ɛnam Yesu so na wɔka bɔne fakyɛ ho asɛm kyerɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mote aseɛ sɛ, obiara a ɔgye no di no, wɔabu no bem a anka Mose mmara ntumi mmu no no. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Monhwɛ yie na adiyifoɔ no nkɔm a wɔhyɛɛ yi amma no so:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>“ ‘Mo fɛdifoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Momma ɛnyɛ mo nwanwa na mo ho nnwiri mo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ɛfiri sɛ, merebɛyɛ biribi wɔ mo berɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">na sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">morennye nni!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Paulo ne Barnaba refiri asɔredan no mu no, nnipa no srɛɛ wɔn sɛ Homeda a ɛreba no, wɔmmra mmɛkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn bio. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Nnipa no wiee nhyiamu no, Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ bebree a wɔasakyera aba Yudasom mu no tu dii Paulo ne Barnaba akyi. Asomafoɔ no tuu wɔn fo, hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran sɛ wɔntena ase Onyankopɔn adom mu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomafoɔ No Kɔ Amanamanmufoɔ Nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Homeda a ɛdi so no duruiɛ no, ɛkame ayɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔte kuro no mu no nyinaa bɛtiee Awurade asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Yudafoɔ no hunuu nnipakuo no, wɔn ani bereeɛ, ma wɔsɔre gyee nsɛm a Paulo reka no ho akyinnyeɛ, kasa tiaa no.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Nanso, Paulo ne Barnaba de akokoɔduru kɔɔ so kaa sɛ, “Mone nnipa a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔka Onyankopɔn asɛm no kyerɛ mo kane. Na sɛ moapo, na mommu mo ho sɛ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ ho hia mo enti a, yɛbɛgya mo hɔ akɔ amanamanmufoɔ no nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Ahyɛdeɛ a Awurade de ama yɛn ne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“‘Mɛma mo ayɛ amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa kanea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ɛnam mo so na wɔbɛgye ewiasefoɔ nyinaa nkwa.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Amanamanmufoɔ no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn ani gyeeɛ na wɔkamfoo Awurade asɛm no, na wɔn a wɔayi wɔn ama nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ no bɛyɛɛ agyidifoɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Na Awurade asɛm no trɛɛ ɔmantam no mu nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Nanso, Yudafoɔ no tuu nnipa atitire a wɔwɔ kuro no mu no ne mmaa Nyamesurofoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ bi a wɔdi mu no aso maa wɔtaa Paulo ne Barnaba, pamoo wɔn firii ɔman no mu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Nanso, asomafoɔ no poroporoo wɔn nan ase mfuturo guu wɔn so firii hɔ kɔɔ Ikoniom. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Anigyeɛ ne Honhom Kronkron hyɛɛ asuafoɔ a na wɔwɔ Antiokia no ma.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ikoniom Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Paulo ne Barnaba duruu Ikoniom no, wɔkɔɔ Yudafoɔ asɔredan mu. Wɔkasa ma Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ bebree bɛyɛɛ agyidifoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Nanso, Yudafoɔ a wɔpoo Awurade asɛm no hwanyan amanamanmufoɔ no, sane tuu wɔn aso tiaa anuanom no. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Asomafoɔ no tenaa hɔ kyɛreeɛ. Na Awurade nam tumi a ɔde maa wɔn ma wɔyɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ no so kyerɛɛ sɛ nsɛm a wɔka fa nʼadom ho no yɛ nokorɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Kuro no mu nnipa no mu kyɛɛ mmienu; ɛfa kɔɔ Yudafoɔ no afa na ɛfa nso kɔɔ asomafoɔ no afa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Amanamanmufoɔ ne Yudafoɔ no ne wɔn mpanimfoɔ yɛɛ adwene sɛ wɔbɛyɛ wɔn ayayadeɛ, asane asi wɔn aboɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Asomafoɔ no tee pɔ a wɔbɔ faa wɔn ho no, wɔdwane kɔɔ Listra ne Derbe a ɛwɔ Likaoniaman mu ne nkuraa a atwa ho ahyia no nyinaa ase. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Wɔkaa Asɛmpa no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obubuafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo ne Barnaba wɔ Listra no, wɔhunuu ɔbarima bi a na ɔyɛ obubuafoɔ firi nʼawoɔ mu. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Paulo rekasa no, obubuafoɔ no tiee no maa Paulo hunuu sɛ ɔwɔ gyidie a ɛbɛma watumi agyina so asa no yadeɛ. Enti Paulo hwɛɛ obubuafoɔ no <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>teaam sɛ, “Sɔre gyina hɔ!” Amonom, obubuafoɔ yi huri gyinaeɛ, hyɛɛ aseɛ nanteeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Nnipa no hunuu deɛ Paulo ayɛ no, wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ teateaam wɔ Likaonia kasa mu sɛ, “Anyame ayeyɛ wɔn ho sɛ nnipa aba yɛn nkyɛn.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Yei enti wɔfrɛɛ Barnaba Seus ɛnna wɔfrɛɛ Paulo nso Hermes,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Seus yɛ Listra abosom mu panin a ɛhɔ na na nʼabosonnan wɔ. Wɔn a na wɔbɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ma Seus no yɛɛ wɔn adwene sɛ wɔde ayɛyɛdeɛ bɛma Paulo ne Barnaba mmom. Deɛ enti a wɔfaa Barnaba sɛ Seus ne sɛ na ɔwɔ animuonyam. Wɔfaa Paulo sɛ onyame Hermes ɛfiri sɛ na ɔyɛ ɔkyeame (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 28:6">28.6</ref></char>).</char></note> ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno na na ɔka asɛm no. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Seus a na nʼasɔredan wɔ kurotia no ɔsɔfoɔ de nantwie ne nhwiren baa kuro no ɛpono ano, pɛɛ sɛ wɔbɔ afɔdeɛ ma asomafoɔ no.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Ɛberɛ a Barnaba ne Paulo tee afɔdeɛ a nnipa no pɛ sɛ wɔbɔ no, wɔde abufuo sunsuanee wɔn ntadeɛ mu, tuu mmirika kɔɔ nnipakuo no mu teateaam sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>“Ɛdeɛn na mopɛ sɛ moyɛ yi? Yɛyɛ nnipa te sɛ mo! Yɛaba sɛ yɛrebɛka asɛmpa no akyerɛ mo, ama moagyae saa nneɛma hunu yi yɛ, na mode mo ho ama Onyankopɔn a ɔbɔɔ ɔsoro, asase, ɛpo ne biribiara a ɛwɔ mu. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Ɛberɛ bi a atwa mu no, ɔmaa nnipa nyinaa kwan maa wɔyɛɛ deɛ wɔpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn nam nneɛma pa a ɔyɛ so di nʼankasa ho adanseɛ. Mmerɛ a ɛsɛ mu no, ɔma osuo tɔ, ma nnɔbaeɛ ba; ɔma mo aduane di, ma monya ahotɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Nanso, saa kasa yi nyinaa akyi no, pɛ ara na nnipa no pɛɛ sɛ wɔbɔ afɔdeɛ ma wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Yudafoɔ bi firi Antiokia a ɛwɔ Pisidia ne Ikoniom tuu nnipa no aso maa wɔsii Paulo aboɔ, twee no firii kuro no mu; na wɔsusu sɛ wawu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a agyidifoɔ no bɛtwaa ne ho hyiaeɛ no, ɔsɔre sane kɔɔ kuro no mu. Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔne Barnaba firii hɔ kɔɔ Derbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Barnaba Sane Ba Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Paulo ne Barnaba kaa asɛmpa no wɔ Derbe maa nnipa pii gye diiɛ. Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔsane kɔɔ Listra, Ikoniom ne Antiokia a ɛwɔ Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Wɔhyɛɛ agyidifoɔ no nkuran sɛ wɔntena ase gyidie mu. Wɔka kyerɛɛ agyidifoɔ yi sɛ, “Ansa na yɛbɛtumi akɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛfa ɔhaw ahodoɔ pii mu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Asafo biara a wɔkɔɔ mu no, wɔsisii mpanimfoɔ maa wɔn; na wɔnam mpaeɛbɔ ne mmuadadie so de mpanimfoɔ no hyɛɛ Awurade a wɔde wɔn ho ato no so no nsa. <verse eid="ACT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Wɔfiri Pisidia no, wɔbaa Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Wɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ Perge, na wɔfiri hɔ baa Atalia.<verse eid="ACT 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Wɔfiri Atalia no, wɔsane baa Antiokia a ɛhɔ na ɛberɛ a na wɔrebɛfiri saa adwuma a wɔawie yi ase no, wɔde wɔn hyɛɛ Awurade adom nsa no. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu Antiokia no, wɔhyiaa asafo no mu nnipa nyinaa. Wɔkaa nneɛma a Onyankopɔn nam wɔn so ayɛ, ne sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn abue ɛkwan ama amanamanmufoɔ agye asɛm no adi no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Paulo ne Barnaba tenaa agyidifoɔ no nkyɛn kyɛreeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Agyinatufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo ne Barnaba wɔ Antiokia no, nnipa bi firi Yudea bɛkyerɛkyerɛɛ anuanom no sɛ, “Sɛ moamma wɔantwa mo twetia sɛdeɛ Mose amanneɛ no kyerɛ no a, morennya nkwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Paulo ne Barnaba ne wɔn gyee saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi ho akyinnyeɛ dendeenden. Saa asɛm yi enti, Paulo ne Barnaba ne Antiokia asafo no mu nnipa bi kɔɔ Yerusalem kɔhunuu asomafoɔ no ne mpanimfoɔ faa saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi ho. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Asafo no gyaa wɔn kwan. Wɔrekɔ no, wɔfaa Foinike ne Samaria kaa amanamanmufoɔ gye a wɔagye asɛm no adi no kyerɛɛ wɔn. Nnipa yi tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn ani gyee yie. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Wɔduruu Yerusalem no, asafo no, asomafoɔ no ne mpanimfoɔ a wɔkaa nneɛma a Onyankopɔn nam wɔn so ayɛ kyerɛɛ wɔn no gyee wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Nanso, Farisifoɔ a wɔabɛyɛ agyidifoɔ no hyɛɛ sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwa amanamanmufoɔ a wɔagye asɛm no adi no nyinaa twetia na wɔdi Mose mmara no so.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Asomafoɔ no ne mpanimfoɔ no hyiaeɛ, dwenee asɛm yi ho. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Wɔdwennwenee ho wieeɛ no, Petro sɔre kasaa sɛ, “Me nuanom, monim sɛ berɛ bi a atwam no, Onyankopɔn yii me firii mo mu sɛ menka asɛmpa no nkyerɛ amanamanmufoɔ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na wɔbɛte asɛmpa no na wɔagye adi. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔnim akoma mu no nam Honhom Kronkron a ɔma ɛbaa yɛn mu no so gyee yɛn too mu no, saa ara na ɔnam Honhom Kronkron no ara so agye amanamanmufoɔ nso atom. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Onyankopɔn anyɛ nyiyimu; ɔnam gyidie so tee wɔn akoma mu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Adɛn enti na mopɛ sɛ mode adesoa duruduru a yɛn agyanom antumi ansoa, na yɛn nso antumi ansoa no soa agyidifoɔ no de sɔ Onyankopɔn hwɛ? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Nanso, yɛgye di sɛ wɔnam Awurade Yesu Kristo adom so na agye yɛn nkwa sɛ wɔn ara.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Ɛberɛ a Barnaba ne Paulo kaa anwanwadeɛ a Onyankopɔn nam wɔn so yɛɛ wɔ amanamanmufoɔ no mu maa nnipa a wɔahyia hɔ no teeɛ no, wɔyɛɛ dinn. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Wɔkasa wieeɛ no, Yakobo kaa sɛ, “Anuanom, montie me! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Seesei ara na Simon kyerɛɛ mu kyerɛɛ yɛn sɛ Onyankopɔn yii amanamanmufoɔ sɛ ne de, de kyerɛɛ dwene a ɔdwene wɔn ho. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Adiyifoɔ no nsɛm a wɔkaeɛ no ne yei hyia, sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ Atwerɛsɛm no mu sɛ:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>“ ‘Yei akyi, mɛsane aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">abɛsi Dawid efie a abubu no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Mɛma deɛ adwirie no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na ma sane masi bio,<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nnipa a wɔaka no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">ne amanamanmufoɔ a me din da wɔn so no bɛhwehwɛ Awurade.’<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Awurade a ɔdaa yei adi ɛberɛ bi a atwam no, ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ yeinom nyinaa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Yakobo toaa so sɛ, “Mʼadwene ne sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛha amanamanmufoɔ a wɔde wɔn ho rema Onyankopɔn no. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Mmom, momma yɛntwerɛ nwoma nkɔka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔdi aduane biara a wɔde ama abosom, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛho nte; afei, wɔntwe wɔn ho mfiri adwamammɔ ho, afei, wɔnnwe aboa a wɔantwa ne mene na ɔwuiɛ; bio, wɔnnni mogya nso. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Ɛfiri tete, Homeda biara, wɔkenkan saa Mose mmara yi wɔ hyiadan mu, na wɔka ɛho nsɛm nso wɔ kuro biara mu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔtwerɛ Krataa Kɔma Amanamanmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Asomafoɔ ne mpanimfoɔ ne asafo no mu nnipa nyinaa hyiaeɛ, yɛɛ adwene sɛ wɔbɛyi nnipa bi afiri kuo no mu aka Paulo ne Barnaba ho na wɔakɔ Antiokia. Wɔyii mmarima atitire baanu a wɔn din de Yuda, a wɔfrɛ no Barsaba ne Silas. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Nwoma a wɔde ma wɔkɔeɛ no mu nsɛm nie:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Anuanom amanamanmufoɔ a mote Antiokia, Siria ne Kilikia,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Asomafoɔ ne mpanimfoɔ ne anuanom a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no kyea mo.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Yɛtee sɛ anuanom bi a yɛmmaa wɔn tumi firi yɛn mu nam wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ so tanee mo ani, haa mo adwene. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Yei enti, yɛatu nnipa bi sɛ wɔmmra mo nkyɛn. Saa nnipa no ne Paulo ne Barnaba <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>a wɔde wɔn nkwa abɔ afɔdeɛ ama Awurade Yesu Kristo no na ɛbɛba. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Afei, yɛresoma Yuda ne Silas a wɔbɛba abɛka asɛm korɔ no ara a ɛwɔ nwoma yi mu no akyerɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Honhom Kronkron ne yɛn ayɛ adwene sɛ, saa ahyɛdeɛ yi akyi no, yɛremfa adesoa foforɔ bi a emu yɛ duru nnsoa mo; <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>monnni aduane a wɔde ama abosom; saa ara nso na monnni mogya. Monnwe aboa a wɔantwa ne mene na ɔwuiɛ. Bio, montwe mo ho mfiri adwamammɔ ho. Sɛ motumi di saa ahyɛdeɛ yi so a, ɛbɛsi mo yie.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Yɛsane kyea mo.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Wɔgyaa nnipa no kwan maa wɔkɔɔ Antiokia. Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔhyiaa agyidifoɔ no de nwoma no maa wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Agyidifoɔ no kenkanee nwoma no no, emu nkuranhyɛsɛm no maa wɔn ani gyeeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Yuda ne Silas a wɔyɛ adiyifoɔ no ne anuanom no kasa kyɛreeɛ, hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Wɔdii nna kakra wɔ hɔ no, anuanom no gyaa wɔn kwan asomdwoeɛ mu maa wɔsane kɔɔ anuanom a wɔsomaa wɔn no nkyɛn dwoodwoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Nanso, Silas de, wankɔ bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tete atwerɛ no binom mmfa nkyekyɛmu 34 nka ho.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Paulo ne Barnaba dii nna kakra wɔ Antiokia, boaa anuanom bi maa wɔkyerɛkyerɛeɛ, kaa Awurade asɛm.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Barnaba Ntam Tete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Nna bi akyi no, Paulo ka kyerɛɛ Barnaba sɛ, “Ma yɛnsane nkɔsra anuanom a wɔwɔ nkuro a yɛaka Awurade asɛm wɔ so no nyinaa nkɔhwɛ sɛdeɛ wɔrekɔ so wɔ gyidie mu.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnaba pɛɛ sɛ wɔde Yohane Marko ka wɔn ho kɔ, <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>nanso Paulo ampene so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔwɔ Pamfilia no, ɔgyaa wɔn hɔ a ɔne wɔn antena hɔ ankɔsi awieeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Akasakasa a emu yɛ den sii wɔn ntam maa wɔn mu teteeɛ. Barnaba faa Marko ne no kɔɔ Kipro <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>na Paulo nso faa Silas. Anuanom no de wɔn hyɛɛ Onyankopɔn adom nsa maa wɔfirii hɔ kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Ɔkɔfaa Siria ne Kilikia hyɛɛ asafo no den.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Timoteo Kɔka Paulo Ne Silas Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Paulo toaa nʼakwantuo no so kɔɔ Derbe ne Listra. Ɛhɔ na na ogyidini bi a ne din de Timoteo a ne maame yɛ Yudani ogyidini na nʼagya nso yɛ Helani no te. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Anuanom a na wɔwɔ Listra ne Ikoniom no nyinaa dii Timoteo ho adanseɛ pa. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Esiane sɛ na Paulo pɛ sɛ ɔde Timoteo ka ne ho kɔ enti, ɔtwaa no twetia, ɛfiri sɛ, Yudafoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa nim sɛ Timoteo agya yɛ Helani. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Kuro biara a wɔduruu so no, wɔkaa mmara a asomafoɔ ne mpanimfoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem ahyɛ sɛ wɔnni so no kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Asafo no nyinii gyidie mu na daa nnipa bebree bɛkaa wɔn ho.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Twa Bra Makedonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Esiane sɛ Honhom Kronkron amma wɔn ɛkwan sɛ wɔnka asɛm no wɔ Asia no enti, wɔkɔɔ Frigia ne Galatia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Wɔduruu Misia hyeɛ so no, wɔpɛɛ sɛ anka wɔkɔ Bitinia, nanso Yesu Honhom no amma wɔn ɛkwan. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Enti, wɔfaa Misia kɔsii Troa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Ɛda no anadwo Paulo hunuu anisoadeɛ sɛ ɔbarima bi a ɔfiri Makedonia gyina hɔ resrɛ no sɛ, “Twa bra Makedonia bɛboa yɛn!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Anisoadehunu yi akyi no, yɛboaboaa yɛn ho sɛ yɛbɛkɔ Makedonia, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛtee aseɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn na wafrɛ yɛn sɛ yɛnkɔka asɛmpa no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidia Adwensakyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Yɛde ɛhyɛn firii Troa kɔɔ Samotrake na adeɛ kyeeɛ no, yɛduruu Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Yɛfiri hɔ no, yɛtoaa so kɔɔ Filipi, kuro titire a ɛwɔ Makedonia mansini a na Romafoɔ di so no mu. Yɛdii nna kakra wɔ saa kuro yi mu.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Homeda duruiɛ no, yɛfirii kuro no mu kɔɔ asubɔnten bi ho baabi a yɛate sɛ Yudafoɔ taa hyia wɔ hɔ bɔ mpaeɛ. Yɛkyerɛkyerɛɛ mmaa bi a wɔbaa hɔ no Atwerɛsɛm no. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Mmaa a wɔbɛtiee asɛm no mu baako ne Tiatirani Lidia a na ɔtɔn ntoma kɔkɔɔ. Na ɔyɛ Onyamesom ni enti Awurade buee nʼakoma mu maa ɔtiee asɛm a na Paulo reka no, gye diiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Wɔbɔɔ ɔne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa asu wieeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ yɛn sɛ, “Sɛ mogye tom sɛ meyɛ Awurade mu ogyidini ampa ara a, mommɛtena me fie.” Ɔkɔɔ so srɛɛ yɛn ara kɔsii sɛ yɛpeneeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Silas Da Afiase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Ɛda bi a yɛrekɔ baabi a yɛhyia bɔ mpaeɛ no, yɛhyiaa afenaa bi a akɔm honhom wɔ ne mu a ɔde nʼakɔm no hyɛ nkɔm ma ne wuranom nya wɔn ho. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Ɔdii yɛne Paulo akyi teateaam sɛ, “Saa nnipa yi yɛ Ɔsorosoroni Onyankopɔn no asomfoɔ a wɔaba sɛ wɔrebɛka nkwagyeɛ ho asɛm akyerɛ mo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Yei kɔɔ so ara kɔsii sɛ da bi Paulo de ahometeɛ teateaa honhommɔne no sɛ, “Mehyɛ wo Yesu Kristo din mu sɛ, tu firi ne mu kɔ!” Amonom hɔ ara, na honhommɔne no tu firii afenaa no mu.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Ɛberɛ a afenaa no wuranom hunuu sɛ deɛ ɛma wɔn sika no afiri wɔn nsa no, wɔkyeree Paulo ne Silas twee wɔn kɔɔ mpanin anim wɔ adwabɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Wɔde wɔn brɛɛ mpanin bɔɔ wɔn soboɔ sɛ, “Saa nnipa yi yɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔde wɔn nneyɛeɛ ne wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ redane yɛn kuro yi ani. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Wɔrekyerɛkyerɛ amanneɛ bi a ɛsiane sɛ yɛyɛ Romafoɔ enti, yɛn mmara mma yɛn ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛgye tom.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔwɔ hɔ no to hyɛɛ wɔn so, na mpanin no tetee Paulo ne Silas ntadeɛ mu, hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ wɔn mmaa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Wɔbɔɔ wɔn mmaa pii wieeɛ no, wɔde wɔn kɔguu afiase, na mpanin no hyɛɛ afiase sohwɛfoɔ no sɛ ɔnto wɔn mu yie sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔrennwane. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Afiase sohwɛfoɔ no tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔde wɔn kɔguu afiase hɔ dan a ɛwɔ mfimfini no mu de nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn guguu wɔn nan de bobɔɔ dua mu.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Ɔdasuom a Paulo ne Silas rebɔ mpaeɛ reto nnwom ayi Onyankopɔn ayɛ, na nneduafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no nso retie wɔn no, <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>prɛko pɛ, asase wosoo dendeenden maa afiase no nnyinasoɔ nso wosoeɛ maa apono no nyinaa buebueeɛ, na nneduafoɔ no nyinaa nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn teteeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Ɛberɛ a afiase sohwɛfoɔ no firi nna mu nyaneeɛ na ɔhunuu sɛ afiase no apono no abuebue no, ɔsusuu sɛ nneduafoɔ no nyinaa adwane enti ɔtwee ne sekan pɛɛ sɛ anka ɔde kum ne ho.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɔdeduani bi dwane a, wɔde ne sohwɛfoɔ si nʼanan mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:19">12.19</ref></char>). Sɛ sohwɛfoɔ no kum ne ho, a na aniwuo ne adwendwene biara to atwa.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Nanso, Paulo teaam ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nkum wo ho! Yɛn nyinaa wɔ ha!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Ɛhɔ ara afiase sohwɛfoɔ no frɛ maa wɔde kanea brɛɛ no na ɔde ahopopoɔ ne suro bɛhwee Paulo ne Silas anim. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Afei, ɔde wɔn firii adi bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Awuranom, ɛdeɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Gye Awurade Yesu di na ɔbɛgye wo ne wo fiefoɔ nyinaa nkwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Afei, wɔkaa Awurade ho asɛm kyerɛɛ afiase sohwɛfoɔ no ne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Anadwo no ara, afiase sohwɛfoɔ yi hohoroo Paulo ne Silas mmaabɔ akuro no anim. Afei, ɔmaa wɔbɔɔ ɔne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa asu. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Afiase sohwɛfoɔ yi de Paulo ne Silas kɔɔ efie kɔmaa wɔn aduane diiɛ na ɔne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa ho sanee wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, afei de, wɔagye Onyankopɔn adi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔgyaa Asomafoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, mpanin no somaa asraafoɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ afiase sohwɛfoɔ no sɛ, “Gyaa saa nnipa no ma wɔnkɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Afiase sohwɛfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Paulo sɛ, “Mpanin no asoma abɛka sɛ mennyaa wo ne Silas ma monkɔ. Enti, monkɔ asomdwoeɛ mu.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Nanso, Paulo ka kyerɛɛ asraafoɔ no sɛ, “Yɛyɛ Romafoɔ. Wɔammu yɛn fɔ wɔ bɔne biara ho na wɔde yɛn baa adwabɔeɛ, bɛbɔɔ yɛn mmaa, de yɛn guu afiase. Afei na mopɛ sɛ mogyaa yɛn sum ase? Dabi! Mpanin no ankasa mmra ha mmɛgyaa yɛn.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Asraafoɔ no sane kɔbɔɔ Roma mpanin no amaneɛ. Wɔtee sɛ Paulo ne Silas yɛ Romafoɔ no, wɔsuroeɛ <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>enti wɔkɔmaa wɔn dibem, yii wɔn firii afiase hɔ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmfiri kuro no mu. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Paulo ne Silas firii afiase hɔ kɔɔ Lidia fie. Wɔkɔtoo anuanom no wɔ hɔ, hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran. Afei wofirii hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Silas Kɔ Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Wɔtoaa wɔn akwantuo no so firii Amfipoli ne Apolonia baa Tesalonika a na Yudafoɔ hyiadan wɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Sɛdeɛ Paulo taa yɛ no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu mprɛnsa ne nnipa no gyee akyinnyeɛ wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no ho, <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>kyerɛɛ mu, dii adanseɛ sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ, Agyenkwa no hunu amane na ɔsɔre firi awufoɔ mu. Paulo kaa sɛ, “Saa Yesu a mereka ne ho asɛm akyerɛ mo yi ne Agyenkwa no.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Nnipa no bi gye diiɛ maa wɔdii Paulo ne Silas akyi. Saa ara nso na Helafoɔ bebree a wɔsom Onyankopɔn ne mmaa mpanin bi nso gye diiɛ de wɔn ho bɔɔ wɔn ara no no.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no ani bereeɛ enti wɔboaboaa ahuhufoɔ bi ano maa wɔbɔɔ twi faa kuro no mu kɔtwaa Yason fie ho hyiaeɛ, pɛɛ sɛ wɔn nsa ka Paulo ne Silas de wɔn brɛ mpanin no. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Esiane sɛ wɔn nsa anka wɔn no enti, wɔtwee Yason ne anuanom bi de wɔn baa mpanin no anim teateaam sɛ, “Saa nnipa a wɔma basabasa ba baabiara a wɔkɔ no aba yɛn kuro yi mu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>ama Yason agye wɔn atena ne fie. Wɔn nyinaa abu Ɔhempɔn Kaesare mmara a ɔde ama yɛn sɛ yɛnni so no so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔka sɛ, ɔhene foforɔ bi wɔ hɔ a wɔfrɛ no Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Saa asɛm yi hwanyanee dɔm no ne kuro no mu mpanin no. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Kuro no mu mpanin no maa Yason ne anuanom no tuaa sika bi de dii wɔn agyinamu maa wɔgyaa wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Silas Kɔ Beroia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Adeɛ saeɛ ara pɛ, anuanom yi gyaa Paulo ne Silas ɛkwan ma wɔkɔɔ Beroia. Wɔduruiɛ no, wɔkɔɔ Yudafoɔ hyiadan mu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Na nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyɛ akyinnyegyefoɔ te sɛ Tesalonikafoɔ no. Wɔde ahosɛpɛ gyee asɛm no diiɛ a daa na wɔsua Atwerɛsɛm no pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu sɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ a Paulo kyerɛkyerɛ no yɛ nokorɛ anaa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Nnipa no mu bebree a Helafoɔ mmaa atitire ne mmarima ka ho no gyee nkyerɛkyerɛ no diiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Tesalonika no tee sɛ Paulo akɔka Onyankopɔn asɛm no wɔ Beroia no, wɔkɔɔ hɔ nso kɔhwanyanee ɛhɔfoɔ no nso. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Enti, ntɛm ara, anuanom no gyaa Paulo ɛkwan sɛ ɔnkɔ mpoano, nanso Silas ne Timoteo de, wɔtenaa Beroia. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Nnipa a wɔkɔgyaa Paulo ɛkwan no de no kɔduruu Atene. Wɔresane akɔ Beroia no, Paulo kraa wɔn sɛ wɔnka nkyerɛ Silas ne Timoteo sɛ wɔmmɛka ne ho ntɛm.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Wɔ Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo retwɛn Silas ne Timoteo wɔ Atene no, ɔhunuu ahoni pii wɔ kuro no mu. Yei maa ne werɛ hoeɛ yie. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Enti, na ɔne Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a wɔsom Onyankopɔn no taa hyia wɔ hyiadan mu ma ɔkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn asɛm. Saa ara nso na daa na ɔne nkurɔfoɔ gye akyinnyeɛ wɔ adwabɔeɛ ara no no. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Afei, ɔne Epikurofoɔ ne Stoikfoɔ anyansafoɔ bi nso gyee akyinnyeɛ. Ebinom kaa sɛ, “na ɛdeɛn na ɔtoatoafoɔ yi pɛ sɛ ɔkyerɛ yi?” Afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Ɛsɛ deɛ ɔreka anyame afoforɔ bi ho asɛm.” Deɛ enti a wɔkaa yei ne sɛ, na Paulo reka Yesu Kristo ne ne wusɔreɛ ho asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Wɔde Paulo kɔɔ Areopago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asekyerɛ ne “Ares kokoɔ.” Ares yɛ Helafoɔ nyame a ɔgyina hɔ ma aprannaa ne ɔko.</char></note> nhyiamu anim kaa sɛ, “Yɛpɛ sɛ yɛte nkyerɛkyerɛ foforɔ a worekyerɛkyerɛ yi ase, <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>ɛfiri sɛ, nsɛm a woka no bi yɛ yɛn asom asɛm foforɔ, enti yɛpɛ sɛ wokyerɛkyerɛ yɛn mu yie.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Na Atenefoɔ ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no nni hwee yɛ sɛ wɔde wɔn adagyeɛ nyinaa bɛtie nsɛm foforɔ anaa wɔbɛka nsɛm foforɔ a wɔate no akyerɛ afoforɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Asɛnka Wɔ Areopago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Paulo sɔre gyinaa Areopago nhyiamu no anim kaa sɛ, “Atenefoɔ, mehunu sɛ moyɛ nnipa a mopɛ nyamesom yie. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, metuu mpase faa mo kuro yi mu, na mehunuu mmeaeɛ ahodoɔ a mosom no, mehunuu afɔrebukyia bi a wɔatwerɛ ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="ACT 17:23">Onyame a wɔnnim no no de.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:23">Enti, adeɛ a monnim na mosɔre no no, ɛno ho asɛm na mereka akyerɛ mo yi.<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>“Onyankopɔn a ɔbɔɔ ewiase ne nneɛma a ɛwɔ mu nyinaa no na ɔyɛɛ ɔsoro ne asase. Awurade no nte asɔredan a nnipa asi mu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Saa ara nso na biribiara a nnipa nam wɔn dwumadie so de bɛma no no nso ho nhia no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno na ɔma nnipa nkwa ne biribiara a ɛhia wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Ɔnam onipa baako so na ɔbɔɔ nnipa ahodoɔ nyinaa de wɔn tenaa asase so. Ɔno ankasa na ansa na ɔrebɛbɔ nnipa no, ɔhyehyɛɛ amanaman ɛberɛ a wɔbɛsɔre ne ɛberɛ a wɔbɛhwe ase. Saa ara nso na ɔhyehyɛɛ wɔn tenabea ahyeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Ɛwom sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛn yɛn de, nanso ɔyɛ yei sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a nnipa bɛhwehwɛ nʼakyi kwan atwe abɛn no; <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>sɛdeɛ obi ka sɛ, ‘Ne mu na yɛte ase na yɛkeka yɛn ho’ no no. Saa ara nso na mo nnwomtofoɔ bi nso aka sɛ, ‘Yɛn nso yɛyɛ ne mma’ no.<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>“Ɛnneɛ sɛ yɛyɛ Onyankopɔn mma de a, ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛsusu sɛ Onyankopɔn tebea te sɛ ohoni bi a onipa de dwetɛ anaa sika anaa ɛboɔ ayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Onyankopɔn buu nʼani guu ɛberɛ a na nnipa nnim no no so, nanso afei de, ɔhyɛ nnipa nyinaa sɛ wɔntwe wɔn ho mfiri akwammɔne so. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wayi da bi ato hɔ a ɔnam onipa bi a wayi no no so bɛbu nnipa nyinaa atɛntenenee. Ɔnam sɔre a ɔmaa saa onipa yi sɔre firii awufoɔ mu no so adi adanseɛ akyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no tee sɛ Paulo reka owusɔreɛ ho asɛm no, ebinom dii ne ho fɛw, na afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Yɛpɛ sɛ wosane ka saa asɛm no bio.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Saa nsɛm a ɛkɔɔ so yi maa Paulo firii nhyiamu no ase hɔ kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Nanso, nnipa kakra bi gyee no diiɛ de wɔn ho bɔɔ no. Saa nnipa no mu bi ne Dionisio a ɔfra Areopagofoɔ mu ne ɔbaa bi a ne din de Damari ne afoforɔ bi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kɔ Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Yeinom akyi no, Paulo firii Atene kɔɔ Korinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Ɛhɔ na ɔhyiaa Yudani bi a wɔfrɛ no Akwila, a wɔwoo no wɔ Ponto, na ɔne ne yere Priskila firi Italia baa hɔ a na ɛnkyɛreɛ. Wɔfirii Italia, ɛfiri sɛ, na Roma ɔhempɔn Klaudio ahyɛ mmara sɛ Yudafoɔ nyinaa mfiri Roma asase so. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Paulo kɔtenaa wɔn nkyɛn ne wɔn yɛɛ adwuma, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn nyinaa nwono ntomadan. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Homeda biara na Paulo kɔ hyiadan mu kɔka asɛm no pɛɛ sɛ anka ɔdane Yudafoɔ ne Helafoɔ no adwene ma wɔgye di.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Silas ne Timoteo firi Makedonia baeɛ no, Paulo de nʼadagyeɛ nyinaa kaa Awurade asɛm no, dii adanseɛ kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ no sɛ Yesu ne Agyenkwa no. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ no ampɛ sɛ wɔtie Paulo asɛnka, na wɔyeyɛɛ no no, ɔde abufuo poroporoo nʼatadeɛ mu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mo mmusuo ngu mo atifi. Mo afɔbuo nna me so. Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ de rekɔ, merekɔka asɛm no makyerɛ amanamanmufoɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Ɔfirii hɔ kɔtenaa aman amanmuni Nyamesomfoɔ bi a wɔfrɛ no Tito Yusto a ne fie bata hyiadan ho no nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Krispo a na ɔyɛ hyiadan mu panin no ne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa gyee Awurade diiɛ maa wɔbɔɔ wɔn asu. Saa ara nso na Korintofoɔ bebree a wɔtee Awurade asɛm no nso gye diiɛ maa wɔbɔɔ wɔn asu.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Ɛda bi anadwo, Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Paulo wɔ anisoadehunu mu sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro! Mpa aba! Kɔ so ara ka mʼasɛm no,</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, meka wo ho. Obiara rentumi nyɛ wo hwee, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa pii wɔ kuro yi mu a wɔyɛ mʼakyidifoɔ.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Paulo tenaa hɔ afe ne fa kyerɛkyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn asɛm no wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Ɛberɛ a Galio yɛ amrado wɔ Akaia no, Yudafoɔ no sɔre tiaa Paulo, kyeree no, de no kɔɔ asɛnniiɛ, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>kaa sɛ, “Saa onipa yi retu nkurɔfoɔ aso sɛ wɔnkwati Yudafoɔ mmara no mfa ɛkwan foforɔ so nsom Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Paulo yɛɛ sɛ ɔrebue nʼano akasa pɛ na Galio ka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ no sɛ, “Yudafoɔ, sɛ mode asɛm foforɔ bi a ɛfa nsɛmmɔnedie anaa abususɛm ho na ɛbaeɛ a, anka mɛhwɛ maka. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ ɛyɛ akyinnyegyeɛ a ɛfa nsɛm, edin ne mo mmara ho enti, mo ara monkɔhwɛ nka. Merenyɛ saa asɛm yi mu ɔtemmufoɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Na ɔpamoo wɔn firii asɛnniiɛ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Afei, ɛdɔm no to hyɛɛ Sostene a ɔyɛ hyiadan mu panin no so, twee no kɔɔ asɛnniiɛ hɔ kɔboroo no, nanso Galio anka ho hwee.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Sane Kɔ Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Paulo tenaa Korinto kyɛɛ kakra ansa na ɔrekra anuanom no ma ɔne Priskila ne Akwila refiri hɔ akɔ Siria. Esiane ɛbɔ a na wahyɛ no enti, ansa na ɔrebɛkɔ no, ɔmaa wɔyii ne ti wɔ Kenkrea. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Wɔduruu Efeso no, Paulo gyaa Priskila ne Akwila hɔ kɔɔ hyiadan mu ne Yudafoɔ no kɔkasaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ, sɛ ɔbɛtumi a, anka ɔntena wɔn nkyɛn nkyɛ kakra, nanso wampene so. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Mmom, ɔrebɛfiri hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ a, mɛsane aba bio.” Na afei, ɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Ɔduruu Kaesarea no, ɔkɔɔ Yerusalem kɔkyeaa asafo no firii hɔ kɔɔ Antiokia.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Ɔdii nna kakra wɔ hɔ no, ɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ Galati ne Frigia kɔhyɛɛ agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no den.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolo Kasa Wɔ Efeso Ne Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, Yudani bi a wɔfrɛ no Apolo a wɔwoo no wɔ Aleksandria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛwɔ Misraim. Ɛhɔ na wɔkyerɛɛ Apam Dada ase kɔɔ Hela kasa mu. Ɛno ne kuropɔn a ɛtɔ so mmienu wɔ Roma Ahemman mu a na Yudafoɔ dɔɔso wɔ hɔ.</char></note> no kɔɔ Efeso. Ɔyɛ obi a na nʼano ate na ɔnim Atwerɛsɛm no yie. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔnam Awurade ɛkwan so akyerɛkyerɛ no enti, na ɔde nnam kasa, kyerɛkyerɛ nokwasɛm a ɛfa Yesu ho no. Nanso na Yohane asubɔ no nko ara na ɔnim. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ de nnam kasaa wɔ hyiadan no mu. Ɛberɛ a Priskila ne Akwila tee asɛm a ɔreka no, wɔde no kɔɔ efie kɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ no Onyankopɔn asɛm no mu yie.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Ɛberɛ a Apolo pɛɛ sɛ ɔkɔ Akaia no, agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ Efeso no hyɛɛ no nkuran, twerɛɛ krataa kɔmaa agyidifoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no sɛ wɔnnye no. Ɛberɛ a ɔkɔduruiɛ no, ɔboaa wɔn a Onyankopɔn adom enti, wɔabɛyɛ agyidifoɔ no yie. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Ɔde ne nimdeɛ kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn asɛm mu de tuu Yudafoɔ no guu wɔ badwam, nam Atwerɛsɛm no so daa no adi pefee sɛ, Yesu ne Agyenkwa no.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Kronkron Si Agyidifoɔ Bi So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Apolo wɔ Korinto no, Paulo tuu ɛkwan faa ɔmantam no atifi kɔduruu Efeso. Ɛhɔ na ɔhunuu agyidifoɔ bi <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛberɛ a mogye diiɛ no, monyaa Honhom Kronkron no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Yɛntee mpo da sɛ Honhom Kronkron bi wɔ baabi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Paulo bisaa wɔn bio sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ na asubɔ bɛn na wɔbɔɔ mo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Asubɔ a Yohane kaa ho asɛm no.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Paulo ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Yohane asubɔ no yɛ ahonu asubɔ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, wɔnnye onipa a ɔdi nʼakyi a ɔreba a ɔne Yesu no nni.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Wɔtee saa asɛm yi no, wɔmaa wɔbɔɔ wɔn asu wɔ Awurade Yesu din mu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Paulo de ne nsa guu wɔn so no, Honhom Kronkron baa wɔn so maa wɔkaa kasa foforɔ, hyɛɛ nkɔm. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Na wɔn dodoɔ bɛyɛ mmarima dumienu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Paulo de nnam kyerɛkyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm wɔ hyiadan mu abosome mmiɛnsa pɛɛ sɛ ɔsakyera nnipa no adwene. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Nanso, nnipa no mu bi pirimm wɔn akoma, annye nni, kasa tiaa nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho wɔ atiefoɔ no anim. Enti, Paulo firii hɔ de agyidifoɔ no kaa ne ho kɔeɛ. Na Paulo kyerɛkyerɛ wɔ obi a wɔfrɛ no Tirano suadan mu daa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi kɔɔ so mfeɛ mmienu; enti ɛmaa nnipa a na wɔwɔ Asia mantam mu a Yudafoɔ ne Helafoɔ ka ho no tee Awurade asɛm no.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Skewa Mma Baason No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Onyankopɔn nam Paulo so yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ akɛseakɛseɛ, <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>maa mpo ne nnuku ne nʼatadeɛ nsɛnanimu a wɔde guu nnipa so no tumi saa nyarewa, tuu ahonhommɔne nso.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Yudafoɔ bi a wɔnam asumansɛm so tu ahonhommɔne pɛɛ sɛ wɔde Awurade Yesu din tu ahonhommɔne. Wɔkankye kyerɛɛ ahonhommɔne no sɛ, “Meka Yesu a Paulo ka ne ho asɛm no sɛ, montu mfiri ne mu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Yudafoɔ sɔfopanin bi a na ne din de Skewa no mma baason na na wɔyɛ yei. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Honhommɔne no buaa sɛ, “Menim Yesu, na menim Paulo; na mo nso mone ɛhefoɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Afei, ɔbarima a honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma yi to hyɛɛ wɔn so, pirapiraa wɔn maa wɔde adagya dwane firii efie hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a wɔte Efeso no tee asɛm yi no, wɔbɔɔ hu na wɔyii Awurade Yesu ayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Agyidifoɔ no mu bebree baa badwa mu bɛkaa wɔn bɔne ne wɔn kɔkoamsɛm. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Wɔn mu nkonyaayifoɔ pii de wɔn nkonyaayie nwoma baeɛ maa wɔhyee wɔ nnipa no nyinaa anim. Wɔbuu nwoma a wɔhyeeɛ no boɔ no na ɛyɛ nnwetɛbena ɔpeduonum. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Saa anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ yi maa Onyankopɔn asɛm no trɛɛ tumi so.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Basabasa A Ɛsii Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Yeinom nyinaa akyi no Paulo yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛfa Makedonia ne Akaia akɔ Yerusalem. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Meduru Yerusalem a, akyire no mɛkɔ Roma nso.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Paulo somaa Timoteo ne Erasto a wɔyɛ nʼaboafoɔ no dii nʼanim ɛkan kɔɔ Makedonia, nanso ɔno de, ɔtenaa Asia kyɛɛ kakra.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi ara mu na basabasa a emu yɛ den a ɛfa nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho sii wɔ Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Dwetɛdwumfoɔ bi a wɔfrɛ no Demetrio yɛɛ Artemi abosonnan sɛso. Nʼadwuma no maa nʼadwumayɛfoɔ nyaa wɔn ho sei tam. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Ɔfrɛfrɛɛ nʼadwumayɛfoɔ no ne wɔn a wɔdi saa dwuma ahodoɔ no ara bi no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, monim sɛ yɛn ahonya nyinaa gyina saa dwumadie yi so. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Mo ara moahunu, na moate dwuma a saa Paulo yi redi. Ɔka sɛ, anyame a nnipa de wɔn nsa ayɛ no nyɛ anyame biara. Ɔnam saa asɛm yi so adane nnipa bebree adwene wɔ Efeso ha ne Asia nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Sɛ yɛanhwɛ no yie a, yɛn adwuma yi bɛgye din bɔne. Saa ara nso na obiara remfa ɔbosom Artemi a wɔsom no wɔ Asia ne ewiase nyinaa no nyɛ hwee bio na nʼanim agu ase.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Nnipadɔm no tee saa asɛm a Demetrio kaeɛ no, wɔn bo fuiɛ, hyɛɛ aseɛ yɛɛ basabasa, teateaam sɛ, “Efeso Artemi yɛ kɛse!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Basabasayɛ no trɛɛ wɔ kuro no mu nyinaa. Ɛdɔm no kyeree Makedoniafoɔ baanu a wɔn din de Gaio ne Aristarko a na wɔne Paulo retu ɛkwan no de wɔn kɔɔ adwabɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Paulo pɛɛ sɛ anka ɔkɔ adwabɔeɛ hɔ kɔhyia dɔm no, nanso asuafoɔ no amma no kwan. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Ɔmantam no mu mpanin no mu bi a na wɔyɛ Paulo nnamfo no soma kɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔnnkɔ adwabɔeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Nhyiamu yi yɛɛ basabasa; nnipa no mu bi teateaam kaa nsɛm bi, na ebinom nso teaam kaa nsɛm foforɔ bi, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn mu dodoɔ no ara nnim asɛm ko a ɛde wɔn abɛhyia mu. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Yudafoɔ no piapiaa Aleksandro kɔgyinaa dɔm no anim sɛ ɔnkasa. Yei maa nnipa no bi susuu sɛ Aleksandro enti na wɔahyia hɔ. Afei, Aleksandro nyamaa dɔm no pɛɛ sɛ ɔkasa yi ɔno ne ne nkurɔfoɔ ano. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Ɛdɔm no hunuu sɛ Aleksandro yɛ Yudani no pɛ, wɔteateaam nnɔnhwere mmienu sɛ, “Efeso Artemi yɛ kɛse!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Kuro no sohwɛfoɔ no bɔɔ mmɔden maa dɔm no tɛm dinn. Afei, ɔkasa kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Efeso mmarima, obiara nim sɛ Efeso kuro yi na ɛhwɛ Artemi asɔrefie ne ohoni a ɛfiri soro bɛduruiɛ no so. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Obiara rentumi nnye yei ho akyinnyeɛ enti monyɛ komm, monnyɛ basabasa biara. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Mode saa nnipa yi aba ha wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔnwiaa biribiara mfirii yɛn asɔrefie, nkaa asɛmmɔne biara ntiaa yɛn nyame no. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Sɛ Demetrio ne adwumfoɔ a wɔka ne ho no wɔ obi ho asɛm bi a, asɛnniiɛ ne mpanin wɔ hɔ, wɔmfa mmɛto dwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Nanso, sɛ mowɔ biribi foforɔ bi ka a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔmanfoɔ hyia, fa mmara kwan so ka ho asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Sɛ yɛanhwɛ yie a, wɔbɛka sɛ saa ɛnnɛ basabasayɛ yi firi yɛn. Saa basabasayɛ yi ho nhia. Sɛ wɔbisa yɛn ho asɛm a, yɛrennya anoyie biara.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Ɔkasa wieeɛ no, ɔtuu dwa no.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Firii Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Basabasayɛ yi akyi no, Paulo frɛɛ asuafoɔ no kaa nsɛm de hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran, kraa wɔn firii hɔ kɔɔ Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Ɔkyinkyini faa amantam no mu, tuu asuafoɔ no fo de hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran. Afei, ɔbɛduruu Hela. Ɔdii hɔ abosome mmiɛnsa. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔresiesie ne ho akɔ Siria no, ɔtee sɛ Yudafoɔ no abɔ ne ho pɔ; enti ɔsane nʼakyi kɔfaa Makedonia kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Piro a ɔfiri Beroia no ba Sopater ne Paulo na ɛkɔeɛ. Wɔn a wɔka ne ho kɔeɛ no nso bi ne Aristarko ne Sekundo a wɔfiri Tesalonika ne Gaio a ɔfiri Derbe ne Timoteo ne Tihiko ne Trofimo a wɔfiri Asiaman mu no. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Saa nnipa yi dii ɛkan kɔtwɛnee yɛn wɔ Troa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Yɛdii Apiti Afahyɛ no wieeɛ no, yɛfirii Filipi, na nnanum akyi no, yɛkɔtoo wɔn wɔ Troa, dii nnawɔtwe wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Nyane Eutiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Nnawɔtwe no mu da a ɛdi ɛkan no, yɛhyiaam sɛ anuanom didiiɛ. Esiane sɛ na adeɛ kye a Paulo bɛfiri kuro no mu no enti, ɔkasa kyerɛɛ anuanom no kɔsii ɔdasuom. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Na nkanea pii wɔ abansoro dan a yɛahyia wɔ hɔ no mu. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo rekasa no, na aberanteɛ bi a wɔfrɛ no Eutiko te mfɛnsere ano retɔ nko. Ɔdaa hatee maa ɔfiri abansoro dan a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa no so bɛhwee fam. Wɔmaa ne so no, na wawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Paulo siane baa fam, kɔbutuu ne so, maa ne so kaa sɛ, “Monnsuro, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnwuiɛ!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Afei, ɔsane foro kɔɔ abansoro no so kɔbubuu burodo ne asuafoɔ no diiɛ. Paulo toaa ne kasa no so kɔsii adekyeɛ ansa na ɔregya wɔn hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Anuanom no de anigyeɛ de aberanteɛ a wɔnyanee no no kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kɔ Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Yɛde ɛhyɛn dii ɛkan kɔɔ Aso sɛ yɛrekɔfa Paulo wɔ hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, na waka akyerɛ yɛn sɛ ɔrefa fam akɔ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Ɔbɛkaa yɛn ho wɔ Aso na yɛne no toaa so kɔɔ Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, yɛkɔduruu Kio. Ne nnanu so no, yɛbɛduruu Samo; na nʼadekyeeɛ no, yɛbɛduruu Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Esiane sɛ na Paulo ho pere no sɛ, sɛ ɛbɛtumi a ɔbɛduru Yerusalem akɔdi Pentekoste Afahyɛ no wɔ hɔ no enti, ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔrennyina Efeso, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔrenkyɛ wɔ Asia.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Paulo soma firii Mileto kɔɔ Efeso kɔka kyerɛɛ asafo mpanimfoɔ no sɛ wɔnhyia no. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Wɔbaeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Ɛfiri da a ɛdi ɛkan a mebaa Asia no, monim ɛkwan a mefaa so ne mo tenaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ɛwom sɛ ɛnam Yudafoɔ no pɔbɔ so maa mehunuu amane bebree de, nanso mede ahobrɛaseɛ ne nisuo yɛɛ mʼadwuma sɛ Awurade ɔsomfoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Monim sɛ ɛberɛ a na merekyerɛkyerɛ mo wɔ dwam ne afie mu no, mamfa biribiara a ɛho bɛba mo mfasoɔ no anhinta mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Mebɔɔ Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ no kɔkɔ sɛ wɔntwe wɔn ho mfiri wɔn bɔne ho, mfa wɔn ho mma Onyankopɔn, na wɔnnye Yesu Kristo nni.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>“Afei, ɛsiane sɛ Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ me no enti, merekɔ Yerusalem a mennim asɛm a ɛbɛto me wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Deɛ menim ara ne sɛ kuropɔn biara a mɛkɔ so no, Honhom Kronkron bɔ me kɔkɔ sɛ wɔde me bɛto afiase na mahunu amane. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mɛtumi maduru botaeɛ a ɛsi mʼanim no ho na mawie dwuma a Awurade Yesu de maa me sɛ menka Onyankopɔn dom ho asɛmpa no enti, mammu me kra sɛ adeɛ a ɛsom bo.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>“Menim sɛ mo a maka Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm akyerɛ mo no mu biara renhunu me bio. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Ɛno enti, ɛnnɛ, mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, sɛ ɛba sɛ mo mu bi yera a, na ɛmfiri me. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, mamfa Onyankopɔn asɛm no mu biribiara anhinta mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Monhwɛ mo ho so ne nnwankuo a Honhom Kronkron de wɔn ahyɛ mo nsa sɛ ahwɛfoɔ no yie. Monhwɛ wɔn yie, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn de ne Ba no mogya na agye wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Menim sɛ me kɔ akyi no, atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wɔn ho yɛ hu sɛ mpataku bɛwura mo mu abɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Ɛberɛ bi bɛba a, mo mu binom bɛsɔre, nam atorɔ so atwe asuafoɔ no mu bi adi wɔn akyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Ɛno enti, monna mo ho so! Monkae sɛ, mfirinhyia mmiɛnsa a medii wɔ mo nkyɛn no, menam amanehunu ne yea mu tuu mo fo awia ne anadwo.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>“Afei, mede mo hyɛ Onyankopɔn ne ne dom nsɛm a ɛtumi hyɛ mo gyidie den na ɛma monya nʼagyapadeɛ a wasiesie ama ahotefoɔ no nsa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Mʼani ammere obi dwetɛ anaa sika anaa ntoma. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Mo ara modi adanseɛ sɛ, me nsa ano adwuma so na menam mehwɛɛ me ho ne wɔn a wɔka me ho no. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Mede mʼabrabɔ ayɛ nhwɛsoɔ akyerɛ mo sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyere yɛn ho yɛ adwuma de boa ahiafoɔ na yɛkae sɛ, Awurade Yesu ankasa kaa sɛ, ‘Ɔma mu wɔ nhyira sene ɔgyeɛ.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Paulo kasa wieeɛ no ɔne wɔn nyinaa buu nkotodwe bɔɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Wɔn nyinaa suiɛ, bam no, maa no nanteyie. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Deɛ ɛyɛɛ wɔn awerɛhoɔ koraa ne asɛm a ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔrenhunu no bio no. Afei, wɔn nyinaa kɔgyaa no ɛhyɛn no mu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Yɛne Efeso asafo mpanimfoɔ no dii ntetemu no, yɛsii mu nam nsuo ani tee kɔɔ Ko. Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, yɛkɔduruu Rodo na yɛfirii hɔ kɔɔ Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Yɛnyaa ɛhyɛn bi a ɛrekɔ Foinike kɔtenaa mu kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Yɛduruu baabi a yɛn ani tua Kipro no, yɛtwaa ho wɔ benkum fam kɔɔ Siria. Yɛsii fam wɔ Tiro, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɛhɔ na wɔrekɔyi ɛhyɛn no mu nneɛma. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Yɛhunuu asuafoɔ bi wɔ hɔ tenaa wɔn nkyɛn dii nnawɔtwe. Asuafoɔ no nam Honhom Kronkron adiyie so bɔɔ Paulo kɔkɔ sɛ ɔnnkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ duruu sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛfiri hɔ no, yɛgyaa wɔn hɔ kɔeɛ. Asuafoɔ no nyinaa ne wɔn yerenom ne wɔn mma kɔgyaa yɛn kwan kɔduruu mpoano. Yɛduruu hɔ no, yɛn nyinaa buu nkotodwe bɔɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Afei, yɛkrakraa yɛn ho yɛn ho wieeɛ no, yɛkɔtenaa ɛhyɛn no mu maa wɔn nso sane kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Yɛfiri Tiro no, yɛtoaa yɛn akwantuo no so faa nsuo ani kɔduruu Ptolemai. Yɛduruu hɔ no, yɛkɔkyeaa asuafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no dii wɔn nkyɛn da koro. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, yɛfirii hɔ kɔɔ Kaesarea. Yɛduruu hɔ no, yɛkɔɔ ɔsɛmpakafoɔ Filipo a na ɔka mmarima baason a wɔyii wɔn wɔ Yerusalem no ho no fie kɔtenaa ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Na Filipo wɔ mma mmaabunu baanan bi a na wɔhyɛ nkɔm.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Yɛtenaa hɔ kyɛɛ kakra no, odiyifoɔ bi a wɔfrɛ no Agabo firi Yudea baa hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Ɔbaa faako a yɛwɔ no, ɔfaa Paulo abɔsoɔ de kyekyeree ne nan ne ne nsa kaa sɛ, “Asɛm a Honhom Kronkron ka ni, ‘Sɛdeɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no bɛkyekyere onipa a abɔsoɔ yi yɛ ne dea no na wɔde no ahyɛ amanamanmufoɔ no nsa ni!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Yɛtee saa asɛm yi no, yɛne wɔn a na yɛne wɔn wɔ hɔ no nyinaa srɛɛ Paulo sɛ ɔnnkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Osu a moresu de hyɛ me awerɛhoɔ yi ase ne sɛn? Me de masiesie me ho sɛ ɛnyɛ kyekyere a wɔbɛkyekyere me wɔ Yerusalem no na mesuro, na sɛ ɛtwa sɛ mewu mema Awurade Yesu a, mɛwu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Yɛkaeɛ kaeɛ a wampene no, yɛgyae kaa sɛ, “Deɛ Awurade pɛ na ɛnyɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Nna bi akyi no, yɛboaboaa yɛn ho firii hɔ kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Kaesarea asuafoɔ no bi ne yɛn kɔeɛ. Yɛduruu hɔ no, yɛkɔsoɛɛ Mnason a ɔfiri Kipro a ɔgyee Yesu Kristo diiɛ akyɛre no fie.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kɔsra Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Yɛduruu Yerusalem no, asuafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa gyee yɛn fɛw so. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Paulo ne yɛn kɔkyeaa Yakobo ne Yerusalem asafo no mu mpanimfoɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Nkyea no akyi no, Paulo kaa biribiara a Onyankopɔn nam ne som no so ayɛ wɔ amanamanmufoɔ no mu no kyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Wɔtiee Paulo amanneɛbɔ no wieeɛ no, wɔhyɛɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam. Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Onua, wʼankasa wodi adanseɛ sɛ Yudafoɔ mpempem na na wɔabɛyɛ asuafoɔ a wɔn nyinaa nso di yɛn mmara no so. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Saa nnipa yi ate sɛ wotia Mose mmara no ne Yudafoɔ amanneɛ; ɛne sɛ, wokyerɛkyerɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔte amanamanmufoɔ no mu sɛ wɔnntwa wɔn mma twetia na wɔnnni yɛn amanneɛ nso so. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Deɛ ɛbɛyɛ biara, wɔbɛte sɛ woaba ha. Enti, afei yɛbɛyɛ no ɛdeɛn? <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Yɛ deɛ yɛrebɛka akyerɛ wo yi. Mmarima baanan bi wɔ yɛn nkyɛn ha a, wɔresiesie wɔn ho ama amanneɛ ho bɔhyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Wo ne wɔn nkɔ na monkɔdwira mo ho na tua ho ka ma wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛtumi atwitwa wɔn tirinwi. Yei bɛma obiara ahunu sɛ nsɛm a wɔte faa wo ho no mu biara nyɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wʼankasa mpo, wodi Mose mmara no so. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Amanamanmufoɔ a wɔabɛyɛ asuafoɔ no de, yɛatwerɛ akɔma wɔn akyerɛ gyinaeɛ a yɛasi sɛ, wɔnnni aduane biara a wɔde abɔ afɔdeɛ ama abosom; wɔnnni mogya; wɔnnni aboa biara a wɔantwa ne mene ansa na ɔwuiɛ; na afei nso, wɔntwe wɔn ho mfiri adwamammɔ ho.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Paulo ne mmarima no kɔdwiraa wɔn ho. Ɔne wɔn kɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔkyerɛɛ da a wɔbɛwie wɔn ahodwira no ne da a wɔbɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ama wɔn mmaako mmaako.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Nnanson no reyɛ atwam no, Yudafoɔ bi a wɔfiri Asia hunuu Paulo wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ, hwanyanee nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa maa wɔkyeree Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Wɔteateaam sɛ, “Israel mmarima, monsɔre mmɛboa yɛn! Yei ne ɔbarima a baabiara a ɔbɛkɔ no ɔnam ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so tia Israelfoɔ, Mose mmara ne asɔredan yi. Mpo ɔde amanamanmufoɔ bi aba ha de agu Kronkronbea ha ho fi.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Deɛ ɛma wɔkaa saa asɛm yi ne sɛ, na wɔahunu Paulo ne Efesoni Trofimo wɔ kurom hɔ, enti na wɔsusu sɛ Paulo de no akɔ asɔredan mu hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Wɔtee saa asɛm yi no, kuro mu no nyinaa bɔɔ twi, kɔkyeree Paulo, twee no firii asɔredan no mu hɔ. Ɛhɔ ara, wɔtotoo asɔredan no apono no nyinaa mu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Ɛberɛ a ɛdɔm no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkum Paulo no, obi kɔka kyerɛɛ Roma asraafoɔ apem so safohene no sɛ, basabasa asi Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔsafohene no ne asraafoɔ mpanin bi ne asraafoɔ bi de ahoɔherɛ kɔɔ baabi a dɔm no ahyia no. Ɛberɛ a nnipa no hunuu no ne asraafoɔ no no, wɔgyaee Paulo hweɛ.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Ɔsafohene no kɔsɔɔ Paulo mu, kyerɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mmienu ngu no. Afei, ɔbisaa sɛ, “Hwan ne saa ɔbarima yi? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Nnipa no ano antumi ankɔ bɛnkorɔ; ebinom ka sei a, na afoforɔ nso aka sei. Saa basabasa yi amma ɔsafohene no antumi anhunu asɛm pɔtee a asi. Ɛno enti, ɔhyɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ no sɛ wɔmfa Paulo nkɔ aban mu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Wɔde Paulo duruu atwedeɛ no ano no, ɛdɔm no bɔ toaa no enti asraafoɔ no tam no kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Ɛdɔm no tu dii wɔn akyi teateaam sɛ, “Monkum no!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Yi Ne Ho Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Wɔde Paulo rekɔ aban mu no, ɔbisaa ɔsafohene no sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo, mɛtumi maka asɛm bi makyerɛ wo anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Ɔsafohene no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Enti, wote Hela kasa? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Ɛnyɛ wo ne Misraimni a da bi ɔhyɛɛ basabasayɛ ase dii mmarima awudifoɔ mpemnan anim kɔɔ ɛserɛ so no?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Paulo buaa no sɛ, “Meyɛ Yudani a wɔwoo me wɔ Tarso; Kilikia kuro a agye din no mu onipa ne me. Mesrɛ wo, ma me ho ɛkwan na me ne nnipa no nkasa.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Ɔsafohene no maa Paulo ɛkwan ma ɔgyinaa atwedeɛ no so nyamaa nnipa no. Wɔyɛɛ komm no, Paulo kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ Arameike kasa mu sɛ:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>“Anuanom ne agyanom, montie mʼanoyie yi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Wɔtee sɛ ɔka Arameike no, wɔyɛɛ komm koraa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Paulo toaa so sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>“Meyɛ Yudani a wɔwoo me wɔ Tarso a ɛwɔ Kilikia. Wɔtetee me wɔ Yerusalem wɔ Gamaliel nan ase. Mesuaa sɛdeɛ wɔdi Yudafoɔ mmara ne wɔn amanneɛ so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Mebɔɔ mmɔden sɛ biribiara a meyɛ no, mede bɛhyɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam sɛdeɛ mo nyinaa nso reyɛ ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Metaa nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho no nyinaa ma wɔkunkumm wɔn. Mekyeree mmaa ne mmarima de wɔn guu afiase. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Ɔsɔfopanin ne agyinatufoɔ no nyinaa di me adanseɛ sɛ, asɛm a mereka yi yɛ nokorɛ. Wɔn nkyɛn mpo na megyee tumi nwoma sɛ mede rekɔma anuanom Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Damasko no. Saa nwoma no na anka mɛgyina so makyekyere nnipa a wɔdi Awurade asɛm so no agu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn, de wɔn aba Yerusalem na wɔatwe wɔn aso.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>“Owigyinaeɛ a mereyɛ maduru Damasko no, prɛko pɛ, hann bi twa faa me ho. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Metwa hwee fam, na metee nne bi a ɛrebisa me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Saulo! Saulo! Adɛn enti na wotaa me?’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>“Mebisaa sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛ wo hwan, Awurade?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">“Ɛnne no buaa me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Ɛyɛ me Nasareni Yesu a wotaa me no.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Nnipa a na wɔne me nam no hunuu hann no de, nanso wɔante nne a ɛkasa kyerɛɛ me no.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>“Mebisaa sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na menyɛ, Awurade?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">“Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Sɔre na kɔ Damasko, na ɛhɔ na mɛkyerɛ wo biribiara a mepɛ sɛ woyɛ.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Hann no hyerɛn ano den maa mʼani firaeɛ enti nnipa a na me ne wɔn rekɔ no sosɔɔ me nsa de me kɔɔ Damasko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>“Na Onipa bi a wɔfrɛ no Anania a ɔdi Mose mmara so a na Yudafoɔ nyinaa di no ni no te Damasko hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Ɔbaa me nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, ‘Onua Saulo, hunu adeɛ bio!’<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>“Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Yɛn nananom Onyankopɔn ayi wo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wobɛyɛ nʼapɛdeɛ na woahunu ɔteneneeni no, na wobɛte nʼankasa ne nne sɛ ɛkasa kyerɛ wo. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Wobɛdi adanseɛ afa biribiara a woahunu na woate wɔ Awurade ho no akyerɛ nnipa nyinaa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Afei, ɛdeɛn na woretwɛn bio? Sɔre na ma wɔmmɔ wo asu nhohoro wo bɔne wɔ Yesu din mu.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsoma Paulo Amanamanmufoɔ Nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>“Mesane mekɔɔ Yerusalem na merebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>mehunuu Awurade wɔ anisoadehunu mu na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Yɛ ntɛm firi Yerusalem ha, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa a wɔwɔ ha no rentie adanseɛ a wodi fa me ho no.’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>“Mekaa sɛ, ‘Awurade, wɔn nyinaa nim pefee sɛ mekɔɔ hyiadan mu kɔkyekyeree asuafoɔ, boroo wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Saa ara nso na ɛberɛ a wɔkumm wo danseni Stefano no, na mewɔ hɔ bi. Mepenee ne kum no so, hwɛɛ awudifoɔ no ntoma so.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>“Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Sɔre na kɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, mɛsoma wo akɔ akyirikyiri, amanamanmufoɔ nkyɛn!’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo kaa sɛ wɔasoma no amanamanmufoɔ nkyɛn pɛ, ɛdɔm no hyɛɛ aseɛ teateaam denden sɛ, “Monkum no! Ɔmfata sɛ ɔtena ewiase!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Nnipa no kɔɔ so teateaam, hugyaa wɔn ntoma, saa mfuturo, to petee ewiem. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Roma safohene no hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Paulo nkɔ aban mu, nkɔbɔ no mmaa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔbɛka deɛ enti a nnipa no nyinaa mpɛ sɛ wɔtie nʼasɛm no. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔkyekyeree no wieeɛ a wɔrebɛbɔ no mmaa no, Paulo bisaa ɔsraani panin a na ɔgyina hɔ no sɛ, “Mowɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ mobɔ Romani a wɔnnii nʼasɛm mmuu no fɔ no mmaa anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔsraani panin no tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔkɔɔ ɔsafohene no nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wopɛ sɛ woyɛ yi? Onipa no yɛ Romani!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Afei, ɔsafohene no kɔɔ Paulo nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Woyɛ Romani anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulo buaa no sɛ, “Aane meyɛ Romani.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Ɔsafohene no kaa sɛ, “Metuaa sika bebree na mede tɔɔ me Roma manbayɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulo nso kaa sɛ, “Me de wɔwoo me sɛ Romani.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Ntɛm ara, nnipa a na wɔrebɛbisa Paulo nsɛm no twee wɔn ho firii ne nkyɛn. Ɔsafohene no tee sɛ Paulo yɛ Romani no, ɔsuroeɛ sɛ wama wɔagu Paulo nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Gyina Asɛnniiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Esiane sɛ na ɔsafohene no pɛ sɛ ɔhunu deɛ enti a Yudafoɔ no asɔre atia Paulo no enti, adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔhyɛ maa wɔyii Paulo firii nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mu. Ɔmaa asɔfoɔ mpanin ne agyinatufoɔ no nyinaa hyiaeɛ. Afei, ɔde Paulo kɔeɛ sɛ wɔnhwehwɛ nʼasɛm no mu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Paulo hwɛɛ agyinatufoɔ no dinn, kaa sɛ, “Anuanom, ahonim pa na mede mayɛ Onyankopɔn adwuma de abɛsi ɛnnɛ da yi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Anania a na ɔyɛ Ɔsɔfopanin no hyɛɛ nnipa a na wɔgyina Paulo ho no sɛ wɔmmɔ nʼano so. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Paulo ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo a wote sɛ ɔfasuo a wɔasra ho fitaa, Onyankopɔn bɛbɔ wo. Wote ha de mmara rebu me atɛn, nanso wobu mmara no so hyɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ me!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Nnipa a na wɔgyina Paulo nkyɛn no bisaa no sɛ, “Sei na ɛsɛ sɛ wokasa kyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɔfopanin?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Paulo buaa wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, mennim sɛ ɔyɛ Ɔsɔfopanin. Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, ‘Nka asɛmmɔne mfa wo ɔman panin ho.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo hunuu sɛ nnipa no bi yɛ Sadukifoɔ na ebi yɛ Farisifoɔ no, ɔteaam wɔ agyinatufoɔ no anim sɛ, “Me nuanom, meyɛ Farisini. Mʼawofoɔ yɛ Farisifoɔ. Gyidie a mewɔ wɔ awufosɔreɛ mu no enti na megyina ha ama wɔredi mʼasɛm yi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Asɛm a Paulo kaeɛ yi maa ntawantawa sii Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ no ntam maa wɔn mu kyɛɛ mmienu, <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>ɛfiri sɛ, na Sadukifoɔ no nnye owusɔreɛ, abɔfoɔ ne honhom nni. Nanso, Farisifoɔ no de, wɔgye saa nneɛma mmiɛnsa no di.<verse eid="ACT 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Nteateamu no kɔɔ so kɔsii sɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mu bi a wɔyɛ Farisifoɔ no sɔre gyinaa hɔ kaa sɛ, “Yɛnhunu bɔne biara a saa onipa yi ayɛ! Ebia honhom anaa ɔbɔfoɔ na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ no!” <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Akasakasa no mu yɛɛ den maa ɔsafohene no suroeɛ sɛ anhwɛ a wɔbɛtete Paulo mu; ɛno enti, ɔhyɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ sɛ, wɔnkɔ nnipa no mu na wɔnkɔgye Paulo mfiri wɔn nsam mfa no nkɔ aban mu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Anadwo no, Awurade bɛgyinaa Paulo nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro! Sɛdeɛ woadi me ho adanseɛ wɔ Yerusalem ha no, saa ara nso na kɔdi me ho adanseɛ wɔ Roma.”</char><verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Paulo Ho Pɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yudafoɔ bi hyia kaa ntam, dii nse sɛ wɔrennidi na wɔrennom nso kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛkum Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Na saa nnipa no dodoɔ bɛboro aduanan. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Afei, wɔkɔɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne mpanin no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Yɛaka ntam, adi nse sɛ hwee renka yɛn ano kɔsi sɛ yɛbɛkum Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Mo ne agyinatufoɔ no nsoma nkɔ Roma ɔsafohene no nkyɛn nhyɛ da nka sɛ, mopɛ sɛ mobisa Paulo deɛ wayɛ no mu yie. Nanso, ansa na wɔde no bɛduru hɔ no, na yɛakum no dada.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Nanso, Paulo wɔfaase bi tee pɔ a wɔabɔ no enti, ɔkɔɔ aban mu hɔ kɔbɔɔ Paulo amaneɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Paulo frɛɛ asraafoɔ mpanin no mu baako ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo ne aberanteɛ yi nkɔ ɔsafohene no nkyɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔwɔ asɛm bi ka kyerɛ no.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Ɔsraani panin no ne aberanteɛ no kɔɔ ɔsafohene no nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Wɔduruu hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔsafohene no sɛ, “Paulo a ɔda afiase no asoma me sɛ memfa aberanteɛ yi mmɛhunu wo na ɔwɔ asɛm bi ka kyerɛ wo.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Ɔsafohene no sɔɔ aberanteɛ no nsa de no kɔgyinaa nkyɛn baabi bisaa no sɛ, “Asɛm bɛn na wowɔ ka kyerɛ me?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Aberanteɛ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yudafoɔ mpanin no abɔ pɔ sɛ ɔkyena wɔbɛhyɛ da abɛsrɛ wo na woama wɔde Paulo abrɛ agyinatufoɔ no sɛ wɔrebɛbisa no ne nsɛm no mu yie. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Nanso, mma wɔnnaadaa wo. Ɛfiri sɛ, mmarima bɛboro aduanan bi a wɔaka ntam, adi nse sɛ wɔremfa hwee nka wɔn ano kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛnya Paulo akum no no bɛtetɛ no wɔ ɛkwan so. Deɛ wɔretwɛn ara ne sɛ, wobɛma ho ɛkwan.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Ɔsafohene no gyaa aberanteɛ no kwan ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nka nkyerɛ obiara sɛ woabɛka asɛm biara akyerɛ me.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Paulo Kɔ Kaesarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Ɔsafohene no frɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ baanu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mompɛ asraafoɔ ahanu ne apɔnkɔsotefoɔ ne mpeakurafoɔ ahanu na momfiri ha anadwo nnɔnkron yi ara nkɔ Kaesarea. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Mompɛ ɔpɔnkɔ mma Paulo na momfa no nkɔma Amrado Felike dwoodwoo.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Afei, ɔsafohene no twerɛɛ nwoma a emu nsɛm ka sɛ:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>Me Klaudio Lisia</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">a meretwerɛ wo Onimuonyamfoɔ Amrado Felike saa nwoma yi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">kyea wo!<verse eid="ACT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Yudafoɔ kyeree saa ɔbarima yi a anka wɔrekum no, nanso metee sɛ ɔyɛ Romani no, me ne mʼasraafoɔ kɔgyee no firii wɔn nsam. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Mepɛɛ sɛ mehunu bɔne ko a wayɛ, enti mede no kɔmaa wɔn agyinatufoɔ no. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Mehunuiɛ sɛ ɔnyɛɛ biribiara a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔgyina so kum no anaasɛ wɔde no to afiase. Asɛm a wɔka too ne so no fa wɔn mmara ho. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Ɛno enti, ɛberɛ a metee sɛ Yudafoɔ bi abɔ ne ho pɔ sɛ wɔbɛtɛ no akum no no, meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede no bɛbrɛ wo. Maka makyerɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ asɛm bi ka tia no no sɛ, wɔmmra wʼanim mmɛka.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Asraafoɔ no yɛɛ biribiara a wɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no. Anadwo no ara wɔde Paulo kɔɔ Antipatri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, asraafoɔ a wɔnam fam no sane wɔn akyi, na wɔn a wɔte apɔnkɔ so no toaa so kɔɔ Kaesarea. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Wɔduruiɛ no, wɔde nwoma no maa Amrado no de Paulo hyɛɛ ne nsa. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Amrado no kenkanee nwoma no wieeɛ no ɔbisaa Paulo ɔman ko a ɔfiri mu. Ɔtee sɛ ɔfiri Kilikia no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>“Wɔn a wɔwɔ asɛm bi ka tia wo no ba a na mɛtie wʼasɛm.” Afei, ɔhyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Paulo nkɔ Herode ahemfie na asraafoɔ nwɛn no.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔdi Paulo Asɛm Wɔ Felike Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Nnanum akyi no, Ɔsɔfopanin Anania ne mpanimfoɔ bi ne mmaranimfoɔ bi a ne din de Tertulo kɔɔ Kaesarea. Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ Amrado Felike nkyɛn de nsɛm a wɔwɔ tia Paulo no too nʼanim. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Wɔfrɛɛ Tertulo ma ɔbɔɔ ne nkuro sɛ, “Onimuonyamfoɔ! Esiane wo nimdeɛ ne wʼakwankyerɛ pa enti, ɛfiri ɛberɛ a wobaeɛ yi, nsakraeɛ pa pii aba yɛn ɔman yi mu ama yɛn ho atɔ yɛn. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Baabiara a yɛwɔ no, yɛka yei ho asɛm na yɛn ani sɔ deɛ woayɛ ama yɛn no da wo ase papaapa. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Mempɛ sɛ mesɛe wo berɛ enti mesrɛ wo sɛ nya berɛ tiawa bi ma me na tie asɛm a merebɛka afa saa ɔbarima yi ho no.<verse eid="ACT 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>“Yɛahunu sɛ saa ɔbarima yi yɛ ɔmammɔfoɔ a ɔde basabasayɛ ba Yudafoɔ nyinaa mu. Ɔyɛ Nasarefoɔ fekuo no mu panin. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔgu asɔredan no ho fi. Ɛno enti, yɛkyeree no yɛɛ yɛn adwene sɛ anka yɛbɛfa yɛn mmara so abu no atɛn. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Nanso, Ɔsafohene Lisia bɛgyee no firii yɛn nsam abrane so, <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmmɛdi nʼasɛm wɔ wʼanim. Sɛ wobisa no a, wo ara ankasa wobɛhunu sɛ nsɛm a yɛreka afa ne ho no nyinaa yɛ nokorɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Yudafoɔ no nso foaa nsɛm a wɔkaeɛ no so, sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Yi Ne Ho Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Afei, Amrado no maa Paulo kwan sɛ ɔnyi ne ho ano. Paulo yii ne ho ano sɛ, “Menim sɛ woyɛɛ ɔman yi so ɔtemmufoɔ akyɛre, ɛno enti, sɛ megyina wʼanim reyi me ho ano a, mensuro. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Sɛdeɛ ebia woate no, ɛbɛyɛ nnafua dumienu ni a mekɔɔ Yerusalem, kɔɔ asɔredan mu sɛ merekɔsom. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Yudafoɔ a wɔde me baa ha yi anhunu me sɛ me ne obi regye akyinnyeɛ wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ anaasɛ meretu nnipa aso wɔ hyiadan mu anaa ɔman no mu baabiara. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Saa ara nso na wɔrentumi nkyerɛ sɛ, nsɛm a wɔreka ato me so yi nyinaa yɛ nokorɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Nanso, megye tom sɛ me ne nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho a Yudafoɔ yi kasa tia wɔn no som yɛn Agyanom Onyankopɔn. Na megye nsɛm a wɔatwerɛ wɔ Mose mmara no ne adiyifoɔ nwoma no mu no nso medi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Mewɔ anidasoɔ a saa nnipa yi nso wɔ wɔ Onyankopɔn mu sɛ da bi, nnipa pa ne nnipa bɔne nyinaa bɛsɔre afiri owuo mu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Yei enti, da biara mebɔ mmɔden sɛ mede ahonim pa bɛbɔ me bra Onyankopɔn ne nnipa anim.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>“Mfeɛ bebree akyi a mefirii Yerusalem no, mesane mebaa hɔ sɛ mede ayɛyɛdeɛ rebrɛ me nuanom na mabɔ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Ɛberɛ a madwira me ho awie na megu so rebɔ aseda afɔdeɛ wɔ asɔredan no mu no, na nnipa a wɔde me baa ha yi hunuu me. Na matwitwa me tirinwi sɛdeɛ mmara no kyerɛ no. Saa ɛberɛ no nso na dɔm biara nka me ho na basabasayɛ bi aba. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Yudafoɔ bi a wɔfiri Asiaman mu wɔ hɔ. Wɔn na sɛ anka wɔwɔ asɛm bi ka tia me a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔka. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Sɛ saa nnipa a wɔwɔ ha yi nso nim asɛm bi a wɔgyina so buu me fɔ wɔ agyinatufoɔ no anim a, wɔnka. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Asɛm baako pɛ na megyina wɔn anim no, mekaeɛ. Saa asɛm no ne sɛ, ‘Gyidie a mewɔ wɔ awufosɔreɛ no mu enti na megye di sɛ morebu me atɛn ɛnnɛ.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Felike a na ɔnim ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no yie no tuu asɛm no hyɛɛ da, kaa sɛ, “Sɛ Ɔsafohene Lisia ba a, mɛdi wʼasɛm no.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Ɔhyɛɛ ɔsraani panin a na ɔhwɛ Paulo so no sɛ ɔmma wɔnwɛn no, nanso wɔmma no ahotɔ kakra. Na sɛ ne nnamfonom de biribiara a ɛho hia no no rebrɛ no a, wɔmma ho kwan.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Gyina Felike Ne Drusila Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Nna bi akyi no, Felike ne ne yere Drusila a ɔyɛ Yudani no baeɛ. Ɔsoma ma wɔkɔfrɛɛ Paulo brɛɛ no maa ɔbɛkaa gyidie a ɔwɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu mu no kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Paulo reka tenenee, ahosohyɛ ne Atemmuo da ho asɛm no, Felike suroeɛ enti ɔkaa sɛ, “Kɔ! Akyire yi, sɛ menya adagyeɛ a, mɛsoma mabɛfrɛ wo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Na Felike ani da so sɛ Paulo bɛma no sika na wagyaa no, ɛno enti, na ɔma wɔtaa kɔfrɛ no ntiantia mu ba ne nkyɛn ne no bɔ nkɔmmɔ no.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Mfeɛ mmienu akyi no, Porkio Festo bɛsii Felike ananmu sɛ amrado. Esiane sɛ na Felike pɛ sɛ ɔsɔ Yudafoɔ no ani no enti, ɔgyaa Paulo wɔ afiase hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Festo Di Paulo Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Festo bɛsii Felike ananmu sɛ amrado wɔ Kaesarea no, ne nnansa so ɔkɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin no de nsɛm a wɔwɔ tia Paulo no bɛtoo nʼanim. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔabɔ Paulo ho pɔ sɛ wɔbɛtɛ no ɛkwan so akum no enti, wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ wɔmma wɔmfa no mmra Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Nanso, Festo buaa wɔn sɛ, ɛsiane sɛ Paulo da afiase wɔ Kaesarea na ɛrenkyɛre biara ɔno ankasa bɛkɔ hɔ enti, <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>wɔn a wɔdi asɛm no anim no ne no nkɔ nkɔdi asɛm no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Festo dii bɛyɛ nnawɔtwe anaa dadu ansa na ɔresane aba Kaesarea. Ɔbɛduruu adekyeeɛ no, ɔtenaa adwa mu dii Paulo asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Ɛberɛ a Paulo bɛduruu asɛnniiɛ hɔ no, Yudafoɔ a wɔfiri Yerusalem no twaa ne ho hyiaeɛ firii aseɛ kekaa nsɛm a ɛnyɛ nokorɛ too ne so.<verse eid="ACT 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Paulo yii ne ho ano sɛ, “Menni biribiara ho fɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, menkasa ntiaa Yudafoɔ mmara; menguu asɔredan ho fi, ɛnna menkasa ntiaa Roma aban nso.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Esiane sɛ na Festo pɛ sɛ ɔsɔ Yudafoɔ no ani enti, ɔbisaa Paulo sɛ, “Wopɛ sɛ mede wo kɔ Yerusalem kɔdi wʼasɛm wɔ hɔ anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Paulo buaa sɛ, “Esiane sɛ Ɔhempɔn Kaesare asɛnniiɛ na megyina enti, ɛha ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi mʼasɛm, bu me atɛn, ɛfiri sɛ menyɛɛ Yudafoɔ bɔne biara sɛdeɛ wo ara wonim no. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Sɛ mabu mmara so anaa mayɛ biribiara a ɛno enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu me kumfɔ a, mensuro. Nanso, sɛ nsɛm a saa Yudafoɔ yi ka tia me no nyɛ nokorɛ a, obiara rentumi mfa me mma wɔn. Medwane metoa Ɔhempɔn Kaesare.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Festo ne ne mpanimfoɔ tuu agyina wieeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ Paulo sɛ, “Esiane sɛ woadwane atoa Ɔhempɔn Kaesare no enti, yɛde wo bɛkɔ nʼanim.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ho Nkɔmmɔdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Nna bi akyi no, Ɔhene Agripa ne Berenike baa Kaesarea bɛmaa Festo akwaaba. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Wɔwɔ hɔ no, Festo ne Ɔhene Agripa dii Paulo asɛm no ho nkɔmmɔ. Festo ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Ɔbarima bi wɔ ha a Felike gyaa no odeduani; <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>na mekɔɔ Yerusalem no, Yudafoɔ asɔfoɔ mpanimfoɔ ne mpanin kaa nsɛm bi tiaa no sɛ mennyina so mmu no kumfɔ.<verse eid="ACT 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>“Nanso, meka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, Roma mmara mma ho kwan sɛ wɔbu obi fɔ ɛberɛ a wɔnnii nʼasɛm; wɔma no ho kwan na ɔyi ne ho ano wɔ asɛm a wɔka tia no no ho. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Wɔbaeɛ no mansɛe berɛ koraa na adeɛ kyeeɛ no, mehyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa no mmra na menni nʼasɛm. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Nanso, wɔanka nsɛm a mesusuiɛ no mu biara anto ne so. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Nsɛm a wɔkaeɛ no fa wɔn nyamesom ne ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Yesu a ɔwuiɛ nanso Paulo ka sɛ ɔte ase no ho. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Esiane sɛ na asɛm no kyere mʼadwene no enti, mebisaa Paulo sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ mekɔdi nʼasɛm wɔ Yerusalem anaa? <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Nanso, Paulo dwane toaa Ɔhempɔn Kaesare. Enti mesane maa wɔde no kɔtoo afiase kɔsi ɛberɛ a metumi de no akɔ Ɔhempɔn Kaesare anim.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Ɔhene Agripa ka kyerɛɛ Festo sɛ, “Mepɛ sɛ mʼankasa metie nʼano asɛm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festo ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyena mede no bɛba na woatie nʼano asɛm.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Gyina Ɔhene Agripa Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Ɔhene Agripa ne Berenike de ahyehyɛ ne ahokeka de asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ ne kuro no mu mpanin kaa ne ho kɔɔ asɛnniiɛ hɔ. Festo hyɛ maa wɔde Paulo baa asɛnniiɛ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Festo kaa sɛ, “Ɔhene Agripa ne mo a moahyia ha nyinaa, saa ɔbarima yi na Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ ha ne Yerusalem no aka nsɛm atia no, de no abrɛ me sɛ memmu no kumfɔ no, <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>nanso mannya asɛm biara annyina so a mede bɛbu no kumfɔ. Esiane sɛ ɔno ankasa dwane toaa Ɔhempɔn Kaesare no enti, mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede no bɛkɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Esiane sɛ menni asɛm pɔtee bi a mɛtwerɛ akɔma Ɔhempɔn Kaesare enti, na mede no aba wo Ɔhene Agripa anim sɛ, sɛ wowie wo nhwehwɛmu a, manya biribi agyina so matwerɛ ne ho asɛm. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Mennye nni sɛ nteaseɛ wom sɛ mede odeduani bɛkɔ nʼanim a mentwerɛɛ biribi pɔtee bi a ɛtia no!”<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Yi Ne Ho Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Ɔhene Agripa ka kyerɛɛ Paulo sɛ, “Afei, mema wo ho ɛkwan sɛ woyi wo ho ano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Paulo maa ne nsa so kasaa sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Ɔhene Agripa! Ɛyɛ me anigye sɛ ɛnnɛ manya mu kwan gyina wʼanim ha reyi me ho ano wɔ asɛm a Yudafoɔ aka atia me no ho. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Deɛ ɛma meka saa ne sɛ, wonim Yudafoɔ mmara ne wɔn amanneɛ nyinaa fekɔɔ. Enti, mesrɛ wo, to wo bo ase tie me.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Yudafoɔ no nim mʼasetena mu nsɛm nyinaa firi me mmɔfraase. Wɔnim mʼasetena mu nsɛm wɔ me kurom ne Yerusalem nso. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Sɛ wɔbɛka nokorɛ a, wɔnim sɛ meyɛ Farisini a medi Yudafoɔ mmara ne wɔn som so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Na afei ɛyɛ bɔ a Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn nananom no enti na megyina ha ɛnnɛ na wɔrebu me atɛn yi. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Saa bɔhyɛ yi na yɛn mmusuakuo dumienu hwɛ ɛkwan sɛ ɛbɛba mu no enti na wɔsom Onyankopɔn awia ne anadwo no. Ɔhene, saa anidasoɔ yi enti na Yudafoɔ asɔre atia me yi. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Adɛn enti na mo Yudafoɔ nnye nni sɛ Onyankopɔn nyane awufoɔ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>“Mmerɛ bi a atwam no, na mʼadwene nyinaa ne sɛ mɛyɛ biribiara a mɛtumi de atia Yesu a ɔfiri Nasaret no din. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Saa ara na meyɛɛ wɔ Yerusalem. Megyee tumi nwoma firii asɔfoɔ mpanin nkyɛn gyinaa so kyekyeree Onyankopɔn akyidifoɔ guu afiase; na sɛ wɔbu wɔn kumfɔ a, medi mu akotene. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Memaa wɔtwee wɔn aso mmerɛ pii wɔ hyiadan mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛpa wɔn gyidie. Mʼani beree wɔn so yie maa metaa wɔn kɔduruu aman afoforɔ so.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ka Nʼadwensakra Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Saa ɔtaa yi enti na mekɔgyee tumi nwoma firii asɔfoɔ mpanin nkyɛn sɛ mede rekɔ Damasko no. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Daasebrɛ, da bi owigyinaeɛ a merekɔ Damasko no, hann bi a ɛkyɛn owia hyerɛn firii ɔsoro bɛtwaa me ne wɔn a yɛnam no ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Yɛn nyinaa twitwa hwehwee fam na metee nne bi wɔ Arameike kasa mu sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Saulo! Saulo! Adɛn enti na wotaa me? Deɛ woyɛ yi nyinaa wode reha wo ho sɛdeɛ nantwie tu ne nan wɔ ɔkafoɔ poma ano.’</char><verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>“Mebisaa sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛ wo hwan, Awurade?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">“Awurade buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Ɛyɛ me Yesu a wotaa me no.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/><char style="wj">Sɔre gyina hɔ. Ɛnnɛ mayi me ho adi akyerɛ wo; mɛma woayɛ me ɔsomfoɔ na woadi adanseɛ wɔ deɛ woahunu afa me ho yi ne deɛ mɛkyerɛ wo nyinaa ho.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/><char style="wj">Mɛgye wo mafiri Israelfoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a wɔresoma wo akɔ wɔn nkyɛn no nsam.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/><char style="wj">Wobɛbue wɔn ani na woatwe wɔn afiri sum mu aba hann mu, na woayi wɔn afiri ɔbonsam tumi ase aba Onyankopɔn nkyɛn. Na wɔnam wɔn gyidie a wɔwɔ wɔ me mu no so anya bɔne fakyɛ na wɔayɛ Onyankopɔn mma.’</char><verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Ɛno enti, Ɔhene Agripa, meyɛɛ ɔsetie maa nne a ɛfiri ɔsoro no. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Mefirii aseɛ kaa asɛmpa no wɔ Damasko ne Yerusalem ne Yudeafoɔ aman nyinaa so ne amanamanmufoɔ mu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔnu wɔn ho na wɔde wɔn ho ma Onyankopɔn, na wɔn nneyɛeɛ akyerɛ sɛ wɔasakyera. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Saa asɛm yi ara enti na mewɔ asɔredan mu resom no, Yudafoɔ no bɛkyeree me sɛ wɔrekɔku me. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Nanso, ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ, Onyankopɔn abɔ me ho ban enti na megyina ha redi adanseɛ akyerɛ obiara yi. Asɛm korɔ a Mose ne adiyifoɔ no kaa sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ Agyenkwa no hunu amane na wadi awufoɔ sɔreɛ mu ɛkan, na wɔaka hann ho asɛm akyerɛ Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Festo Bu Paulo Ɔbɔdamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Paulo gu so rekasa no, Festo tiaa no kaa sɛ, “Paulo, woabɔ dam. Wo nwomanim bebrebe no abɔ wo dam.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Nanso, Paulo buaa sɛ, “Daasebrɛ, memmɔɔ dam. Nsɛm a mereka no yɛ nokorɛ a aba wɔ mu. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Ɔhene Agripa, ɛsiane sɛ wonim saa nsɛm yi nyinaa enti, mɛtumi magyina wʼanim mede akokoɔduru makasa. Megye di sɛ biribiara a ɛsiiɛ no wonim, ɛfiri sɛ, emu biara nni hɔ a ɛyɛ kokoamsɛm. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Ɔhene Agripa, wogye adiyifoɔ no di anaa? Menim sɛ wogye wɔn di.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agripa bisaa Paulo sɛ, “Wogye di sɛ wobɛtumi adane mʼadwene ama mayɛ Kristoni saa ɛberɛ tiawa yi mu anaa?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Paulo buaa sɛ, “Sɛ nsɛm a mereka no ho hia anaa ɛho nhia no, me mpaeɛbɔ ara ne sɛ, Onyankopɔn bɛma wo ne wɔn a wɔretie me ɛnnɛ yi nyinaa bɛsakyera abɛyɛ sɛ me, agye nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a ɛgu me yi nko ara.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Afei, ɔhene no ne Amrado ne Berenike ne wɔn a wɔahyia hɔ no nyinaa sɔreeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wɔkeka kyerɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Saa onipa yi nyɛɛ biribiara a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔgyina so bu no kumfɔ anaasɛ wɔde no to afiase.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Ɔhene Agripa ka kyerɛɛ Festo sɛ, “Sɛ onipa yi nnwane ntoaa Kaesare a anka yɛbɛtumi agyaa no.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kɔ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Wɔsii gyinaeɛ wieeɛ sɛ yɛnkɔ Italia no, wɔde Paulo ne nneduafoɔ bi hyɛɛ Yulio a ɔyɛ Roma asraafoɔ panin no nsa. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Yɛkɔtenaa ɛhyɛn bi a ɛrekɔ Asia fam no mu wɔ Adramitio. Na Makedoniani Aristarko a ɔfiri Tesalonika no ka yɛn ho.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, yɛkɔduruu Sidon. Yulio yɛɛ Paulo adɔeɛ maa ɔkɔsraa ne nnamfo maa wɔmaa no nneɛma a ɛho hia no no. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Esiane sɛ yɛtuu wɔ hɔ no na mframa bɔ hyia yɛn no enti, yɛka kɔɔ Kipro nifa fam. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Yɛnam ɛpo so kɔfaa Kilikia ne Pamfilia kɔduruu Mira a ɛwɔ Likia mantam mu no mu. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Ɛhɔ na asraafoɔ panin no hunuu ɛhyɛn bi a ɛfiri Aleksandria rekɔ Italia. Enti, ɔde yɛn kɔtenaa mu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Ɛhyɛn no kɔɔ brɛoo maa yɛdii nna wɔ ɛpo no so. Yɛbrɛeɛ ansa na yɛreduru Knido. Esiane sɛ na mframa bɔ hyia yɛn no enti, yɛfaa Salmoni hyɛngyinabea ka kɔɔ Kreta nifa fam. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Yɛka kɔɔ mpoano nkakrankakra kɔsii sɛ yɛde ɔbrɛ bɛduruu baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ Hyɛn Agyinaeɛ a ɛbɛn kuro Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Esiane sɛ na afe no rekɔ nʼawieeɛ na saa ɛberɛ no nso ɛpo no so fa yɛ hu no enti, yɛtenaa hɔ kyɛreeɛ. Paulo tuu wɔn fo sɛ, <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>“Anuanom, mehunu sɛ, sɛ yɛtoa yɛn akwantuo yi so a, yɛbɛhunu amane ama ebia ɛhyɛn no abɔ ama emu nneɛma asɛe ama nnipa ahwere wɔn nkwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Nanso, asraafoɔ panin no antie fo a Paulo tuu wɔn no, na mmom ɔtiee nsɛm a hyɛnkafoɔ no ne ɛhyɛn no wura kaeɛ no. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Esiane sɛ na hyɛngyinabea hɔ nyɛ mma sɛ wɔbɛtena hɔ awɔberɛ mu no enti, nnipa no bebree pɛɛ sɛ, sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, anka ɛhyɛn no bɛtu afiri hɔ akɔ Foinike. Foinike yɛ hyɛngyinabea a ɛwɔ Kreta a ɛda atifi ne anafoɔ ntam wɔ Atɔeɛ fam. Ɛyɛ baabi a wɔbɛtumi atena hɔ awɔberɛ mu.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛpo So Mframa A Ɛyɛ Den No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Mframa a ano nyɛ den bɔ firii anafoɔ fam. Yei maa nnipa no susuu sɛ wɔbɛtumi atoa wɔn akwantuo no so sɛdeɛ wɔahyehyɛ no. Enti, wɔtuu sɛkyɛ no de ɛhyɛn no faa Kreta mpoano. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Ankyɛre koraa na mframa kɛseɛ bi a wɔfrɛ no “Atifi Apueeɛ Mframa” bɔ firii supɔ no so. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Mframa no bɔ bunkam faa yɛn ɛhyɛn no so twee no kɔɔ ɛpo no mu. Yɛbɔɔ mmɔden sɛ yɛbɛdane ɛhyɛn no ani na anyɛ yie no, yɛgyae maa mframa no twee no kɔeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Yɛduruu supɔ ketewa bi a wɔfrɛ no Klauda ho a na ɛhɔ mframa ano nyɛ den mpo no, yɛbrɛeɛ ansa na yɛretumi atwe ɛhyɛn no kodoɔ a ɛsɛn akyire no aba mu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Ɛhyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ maa so baa ɛhyɛn no mu, kyekyeree no dendeenden. Esiane sɛ na wɔsuro sɛ wɔbɛkɔ akɔtim anwea mu enti, wɔyiyii ɛhyɛn dua no so ntoma maa mframa no bɔɔ ɛhyɛn no kɔɔ baabiara a ɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Mframaden no kɔɔ so bɔeɛ; ɛno enti adeɛ kyeeɛ no, wɔyiyii ɛhyɛn no mu nneɛma no bi to guu ɛpo no mu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Ne nnansa so no, wɔsesaa ɛhyɛn no ho nneɛma no bi to guiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Nna bebree twaa mu a na yɛnhunu awia anaa nsoromma a na mframaden no gu so retu. Yei maa yɛn anidasoɔ nyinaa saeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kyekye Wɔn Werɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Nna bebree twaa mu a na obiara anidie no, Paulo ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, sɛ motiee me na yɛantu amfiri Kreta a, anka ɛnyɛ ɛne yɛn amanehunu yi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Nanso, momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam, ɛfiri sɛ, mo mu biara renwu na mmom, ɛhyɛn no na ɛbɛbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Nnora anadwo, Onyankopɔn a mesom no no ɔbɔfoɔ baa me nkyɛn <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>bɛka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Paulo, nsuro! Deɛ ɛbɛyɛ biara wobɛduru Kaesare anim ama wadi wʼasɛm. Wɔn a wɔka wo ho yi nso, Onyankopɔn adom enti, biribiara renyɛ wɔn.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Anuanom, momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam, ɛfiri sɛ, megye Onyankopɔn di na asɛm a waka akyerɛ me no bɛba mu pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Nanso, deɛ ɛbɛyɛ biara, ɛhyɛn no bɛbɔ wɔ supɔ bi mpoano.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛhyɛn No Bɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Ne nnawɔtwe mmienu anadwo no a na mframaden no enti ɛhyɛn no redi akɔneaba wɔ Adria ɛpo so no, ɔdasuo mu na ɛhyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ hunuu sɛ yɛrebɛn asase. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Wɔtoo susuhoma hunuu sɛ nsuo no mu tenten yɛ anammɔn ɔha ne aduonu. Ɛyɛɛ kakra a wɔsusuu bio no, wɔhunuu sɛ ɛyɛ anammɔn aduɔkron. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔsuro sɛ anyɛ a ɛhyɛn no bɛpem abotan bi enti, wɔtoo sɛkyɛ ɛnan wɔ ɛhyɛn no akyi twɛn kɔsii adekyeeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Ɛhyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ pɛɛ sɛ wɔdwane. Enti, wɔgyaee ɛhyɛn no kodoɔ no sii ɛpo no ani boapa yɛɛ sɛdeɛ wɔrekɔto asɛkyɛ wɔ ɛhyɛn no anim. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Paulo ka kyerɛɛ asraafoɔ panin no ne asraafoɔ a wɔka ne ho no sɛ, “Sɛ ɛhyɛn yi mu adwumayɛfoɔ no dwane a, mobɛwuwu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Yei enti, asraafoɔ no twaa ahoma a ɛkyekyere ɛhyɛn no kodoɔ no mu no maa ɛkɔeɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Adeɛ reyɛ akye no, Paulo srɛɛ wɔn nyinaa sɛ wɔnnidi. Deɛ ɔkae ne sɛ, “Nnawɔtwe mmienu ni, mo mu biara mfaa aduane nkaa nʼano. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Mesrɛ mo, obiara nnidi sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mobɛnya ahoɔden. Biribiara renyɛ obiara.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Paulo kasa wieeɛ no, ɔfaa burodo bɔɔ mpaeɛ, daa Onyankopɔn ase wɔ wɔn nyinaa anim na ɔbuu bi diiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Amonom hɔ ara, wɔn nyinaa bo tɔɔ wɔn yam ma wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ didiiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Nnipa a na yɛwɔ ɛhyɛn no mu no dodoɔ yɛ ahanu ne aduɔson nsia. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Obiara didi meeɛ no, ɛhyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ no too aburoo a ɛwɔ ɛhyɛn no mu no guu ɛpo no mu ma ɛhyɛn no mu yɛɛ hare.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, hyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ no anhunu sɛ wɔaduru mpoano. Wɔhunuu baabi a ɛpo no adidi akɔ asase no mu a nsuo taa hɔ. Enti, wɔyɛɛ wɔn adwene sɛ wɔbɛka hyɛn no akɔ hɔ ama akɔtim. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Ɛno enti, wɔtwitwaa hyɛn no asɛkyɛ nhoma no mu maa asɛkyɛ no guu ɛpo mu. Afei, wɔsanesanee ahoma a ɛkura akyerɛkyerɛkwan no mu na afei wɔsii ntoma a ɛwɔ ɛhyɛn no anim no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mframa bɛtumi abɔ hyɛn no akɔ mpoano. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Nanso, ɛhyɛn no kɔpem anweatam bi ma ɛtimiiɛ. Ɛhyɛn no anim timii dendeenden ɛnna nʼakyi no nso, asorɔkye a na ɛrebɔ no no ma ɛbubuiɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Asraafoɔ no yɛɛ wɔn adwene sɛ wɔbɛkunkum nneduafoɔ no<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɔdeduani bi dwane a wɔde ne sohwɛfoɔ no nkwa si nʼanan mu. Enti na asraafoɔ no nnyaagyaa wɔn ho na amma ɔdeduani bi annwane.</char></note> nyinaa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, obiara rennya ɛkwan nnwane. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ na asraafoɔ panin no pɛ sɛ ɔgye Paulo nkwa no enti, wamma wɔn ho ɛkwan. Mmom, ɔhyɛɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔbɛtumi adware no ahyɛaseɛ nnware nkɔ mpoano. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Wɔn a aka no nso ntetare mmerɛte ne nnua asinasini a abubu firi hyɛn no mu no so nkɔ mpoano. Saa ɛkwan yi so na yɛnam bɛduruu mpoano nohoa dwoodwoo.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛduru Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Yɛduruu mpoano hɔ no, ankyɛre na yɛhunuu sɛ yɛwɔ supɔ Malta so. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Supɔ no sofoɔ no gyee yɛn fɛ so. Esiane sɛ na osuo atɔ ama awɔ aba enti, wɔsɔɔ ogya ma yɛtoeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Paulo bubuu mmabaa sɛ ɔde regu ogya no mu. Ɔde regu mu no, ɔwɔ bi a ogya no hyeɛ aka no no, bebaree ne nsa ho. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Supɔ no sofoɔ no hunuu ɔwɔ no sɛ ɔbebare ne nsa ho no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Saa onipa yi yɛ owudifoɔ a wanya ne ti adidi mu wɔ ɛpo akwanhyia mu, nanso ɛnam ne bɔne enti, owuo ara na ɛtwa sɛ ɔwu.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Paulo petee ɔwɔ no too ogya no mu a hwee anyɛ no. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Na nkurɔfoɔ no nyinaa susuu sɛ Paulo bɛhonhono anaasɛ ɔbɛtwa ahwe awu. Nanso, wɔtwɛnee ara a biribiara anyɛ no no, wɔsakyeraa wɔn adwene kaa sɛ, “Ɔyɛ onyame bi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Na ɔpanin a ɔhwɛ supɔ no so a wɔfrɛ no Publio no fie bɛn mpoano hɔ; ɔgyee yɛn fɛw so, somm yɛn hɔhoɔ nnansa. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara na Publio agya yaree huraeɛ ne konkurowa a aka no ato hɔ. Paulo kɔɔ ɛdan a na ɔda mu no mu de ne nsa guu ne so, bɔɔ mpaeɛ maa ne ho yɛɛ no den. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Deɛ Paulo yɛeɛ no maa ayarefoɔ a wɔwɔ supɔ no so no nyinaa baa ne nkyɛn maa ɔsaa wɔn yadeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Wɔmaa yɛn akyɛdeɛ bebree. Yɛrebɛfiri hɔ akɔ no nso, wɔde biribiara a ɛho hia yɛn no bɛguu ɛhyɛn no mu maa yɛn.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛfiri Malta Kɔ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Yɛdii abosome mmiɛnsa wɔ supɔ no so ansa na yɛnyaa ɛhyɛn bi a ɛfiri Aleksandria a ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ yɛ etire mmienu a ɛgyina hɔ ma anyame baanu bi. Na saa ɛhyɛn no abɛdi awɔberɛ no wɔ supɔ no so. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Yɛduruu Sidarakusa no, yɛdii nnansa wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Yɛfiri hɔ no, yɛtoaa so kɔduruu Regio. Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, mframa bi bɔ firi anafoɔ fam maa nnanu akyi no, yɛkɔduruu Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Ɛha na yɛhyiaa agyidifoɔ bi a wɔsrɛɛ yɛn sɛ, yɛntena wɔn nkyɛn nnawɔtwe. Ɛno akyi no, yɛtoaa so kɔduruu Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Anuanom a wɔwɔ Roma no tee yɛn nka sɛ yɛreba no, ebinom bɛhyiaa yɛn ɛkwan wɔ adwabɔeɛ a ɛwɔ Apia ɛkwan no so na afoforɔ nso hyiaa yɛn wɔ ahɔhobea bi a wɔfrɛ no Ahɔhodan Mmiɛnsa no. Ɛberɛ a Paulo hunuu wɔn no, ne ho sanee no na ɔdaa Onyankopɔn ase. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Yɛduruu Roma no, wɔmaa Paulo ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔnkɔtena baabiara a ɔpɛ na ɔsraani bi nnwɛn no.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Nnansa akyi no, Paulo frɛɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin ne wɔn hyiaeɛ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, ɛwom sɛ manyɛ bɔne biara mantia yɛn ɔman ne yɛn amanneɛ a yɛn agyanom de gyaa yɛn no de, nanso wɔkyeree me dedua wɔ Yerusalem de me hyɛɛ Romafoɔ nsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Wɔbisaa me nsɛm pɛɛ sɛ wɔgyaa me, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔannya afɔbudeɛ bi wɔ me ho a ɛno enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔgyina so kum me. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ kasatia gyaeɛ a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔgyaa me no, mehunuu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ medwane metoa Kaesare. Ɛnyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ ho adwemmɔne a mewɔ enti na meyɛɛ saa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Yei enti na mepɛɛ sɛ mehunu mo na me ne mo kasa no, na onipa a Israelfoɔ ani da ne so no enti na nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn gu me yi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Wɔbuaa Paulo sɛ, “Yɛnnyaa nwoma biara a ɛfiri Yudea a ɛfa wo ho na yɛntee wo ho asɛmmɔne biara nso mfirii anuanom a wɔfiri hɔ ba ha no nso nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Nanso, yɛpɛ sɛ yɛhunu wʼadwene, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛnim sɛ baabiara nnipa kasa tia Akristofoɔ a wɔn nso woka wɔn ho no.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Asɛnka Wɔ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Wɔhyɛɛ da bi sɛ wɔbɛhyia Paulo. Saa ɛda no duruiɛ no, nnipa bebree kɔɔ ne nkyɛn wɔ faako a ɔte hɔ no. Ɔkaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ wɔn. Ɔnam Mose mmara ne nsɛm a adiyifoɔ no kaeɛ no so kaa Yesu ho asɛm firi anɔpa kɔsii anadwo kyerɛɛ wɔn, pɛɛ sɛ ɔdane wɔn adwene. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Nnipa no bi gyee Paulo asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no diiɛ na ebi nso annye anni. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔregyegye wɔn ho wɔn ho akyinnyeɛ no, wɔfirii hɔ kɔeɛ. Na asɛm a ɛtwa toɔ a Paulo kaeɛ ne sɛ. “Nokwasɛm na Honhom Kronkron nam Odiyifoɔ Yesaia so ka kyerɛɛ mo agyanom sɛ,<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>“Monkɔka asɛm yi nkyerɛ Yudafoɔ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Ɔte deɛ mobɛte, nanso morente aseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ɔhwɛ deɛ mobɛhwɛ, nanso morenhunu,’<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>ɛfiri sɛ mo, moapirim mo akoma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">moasi mo aso, akatakata mo ani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ɛnyɛ saa a anka mo ani bɛhunu adeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">na mo akoma ate asɛm ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">na moanu mo ho asane aba me nkyɛn, na masa mo yadeɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Paulo kaa sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ mohunu sɛ Onyankopɔn nkwagyesɛm no aduru amanamanmufoɔ no nkyɛn. Wɔbɛtie!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Paulo kaa saa asɛm yi wieeɛ no, Yudafoɔ no firii hɔ kɔeɛ a na wɔregyegye wɔn ho wɔn ho akyinnyeɛ dendeenden.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Paulo tenaa hɔ mfeɛ mmienu, a na ɔte efie a ɔno ankasa tua ho ka no mu, na nnipa bebree kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Na ɔde akokoɔduru kaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ne Awurade Yesu Kristo ho asɛm.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
